WEBVTT

1
00:02:19.583 --> 00:02:23.958
<font face="Comic Sans MS">Miss Bai, I think we can get food up ahead.</font>

2
00:02:25.625 --> 00:02:27.208
<font face="Comic Sans MS">Okay, Let's go see.</font>

3
00:02:27.250 --> 00:02:28.000
<font face="Comic Sans MS">Go.</font>

4
00:02:31.375 --> 00:02:32.833
<font face="Comic Sans MS">I just want one bowl.</font>

5
00:02:32.875 --> 00:02:34.000
<font face="Comic Sans MS">One bowl?</font>

6
00:02:34.667 --> 00:02:37.417
<font face="Comic Sans MS">For all of you?</font>

7
00:02:49.083 --> 00:02:52.375
<font face="Comic Sans MS">Teacher, I want to go back to Stone City!</font>

8
00:02:54.625 --> 00:02:56.375
<font face="Comic Sans MS">We're going to a new school.</font>

9
00:02:57.000 --> 00:02:58.583
<font face="Comic Sans MS">We're not going back.</font>

10
00:02:59.333 --> 00:03:01.125
<font face="Comic Sans MS">Here, reach out your hands.</font>

11
00:03:01.958 --> 00:03:03.542
<font face="Comic Sans MS">No matter what happened before,</font>

12
00:03:04.333 --> 00:03:05.833
<font face="Comic Sans MS">we must look ahead.</font>

13
00:03:06.458 --> 00:03:09.000
<font face="Comic Sans MS">We are the bravest and strongest.</font>

14
00:03:10.708 --> 00:03:13.167
<font face="Comic Sans MS">We're a family, and we'll always
stay together, remember?</font>

15
00:03:13.208 --> 00:03:15.083
<font face="Comic Sans MS">Yes!</font>

16
00:03:15.292 --> 00:03:17.042
<font face="Comic Sans MS">Food is coming</font>

17
00:03:17.542 --> 00:03:18.500
<font face="Comic Sans MS">Dry your tears!</font>

18
00:03:20.917 --> 00:03:23.458
<font face="Comic Sans MS">Look, it's Pigsy!</font>

19
00:03:31.875 --> 00:03:32.958
<font face="Comic Sans MS">Your noodles</font>

20
00:03:33.375 --> 00:03:33.875
<font face="Comic Sans MS">Here it is.</font>

21
00:03:33.917 --> 00:03:34.458
<font face="Comic Sans MS">Let's eat!</font>

22
00:03:34.583 --> 00:03:35.708
<font face="Comic Sans MS">I want some!</font>

23
00:03:35.792 --> 00:03:36.875
<font face="Comic Sans MS">Take it easy.</font>

24
00:03:37.000 --> 00:03:37.833
<font face="Comic Sans MS">Waiter!</font>

25
00:03:38.167 --> 00:03:39.917
<font face="Comic Sans MS">Sir, do you want the bill?</font>

26
00:03:40.375 --> 00:03:41.250
<font face="Comic Sans MS">It's 10 dollars in total.</font>

27
00:03:46.167 --> 00:03:46.875
<font face="Comic Sans MS">This is a robbery!</font>

28
00:03:50.625 --> 00:03:52.083
<font face="Comic Sans MS">There's a robbery, run!</font>

29
00:03:53.000 --> 00:03:54.333
<font face="Comic Sans MS">If you wish to escape unharmed,</font>

30
00:03:54.375 --> 00:03:57.708
<font face="Comic Sans MS">Behave and put all your money on the table.</font>

31
00:03:58.625 --> 00:03:59.417
<font face="Comic Sans MS">Listen,</font>

32
00:03:59.792 --> 00:04:01.375
<font face="Comic Sans MS">Today our knives will fly.</font>

33
00:04:01.417 --> 00:04:02.208
<font face="Comic Sans MS">Your money better flow,</font>

34
00:04:02.500 --> 00:04:03.167
<font face="Comic Sans MS">Or else</font>

35
00:04:03.625 --> 00:04:04.250
<font face="Comic Sans MS">your blood will flow!</font>

36
00:04:04.417 --> 00:04:05.042
<font face="Comic Sans MS">You hear me?</font>

37
00:04:06.292 --> 00:04:07.042
<font face="Comic Sans MS">Don't move!</font>

38
00:04:14.208 --> 00:04:17.000
<font face="Comic Sans MS">R... robbery</font>

39
00:04:21.125 --> 00:04:22.167
<font face="Comic Sans MS">Goddammit!</font>

40
00:04:24.000 --> 00:04:25.625
<font face="Comic Sans MS">R... robbery</font>

41
00:04:27.042 --> 00:04:28.292
<font face="Comic Sans MS">Come on!</font>

42
00:04:28.625 --> 00:04:30.000
<font face="Comic Sans MS">Right now is lunch time!</font>

43
00:04:30.208 --> 00:04:31.917
<font face="Comic Sans MS">Everyone is supposed to be eating!</font>

44
00:04:32.042 --> 00:04:34.375
<font face="Comic Sans MS">It's so rude to rob us now!</font>

45
00:04:34.583 --> 00:04:36.708
<font face="Comic Sans MS">Food comas are very uncomfortable.</font>

46
00:04:37.083 --> 00:04:38.708
<font face="Comic Sans MS">I care about my health.</font>

47
00:04:39.250 --> 00:04:41.292
<font face="Comic Sans MS">After I eat, I want to sleep.</font>

48
00:04:41.333 --> 00:04:43.625
<font face="Comic Sans MS">When I sleep, I hate to be interrupted!</font>

49
00:04:44.375 --> 00:04:46.333
<font face="Comic Sans MS">Can't you be a more professional robber?</font>

50
00:04:46.375 --> 00:04:48.500
<font face="Comic Sans MS">You should come back at night for a...</font>

51
00:04:48.542 --> 00:04:50.750
<font face="Comic Sans MS">...R-r-robbery.</font>

52
00:04:59.958 --> 00:05:01.625
<font face="Comic Sans MS">I'll show you robbery!</font>

53
00:05:02.500 --> 00:05:03.667
<font face="Comic Sans MS">I'll show you robbery!</font>

54
00:05:07.083 --> 00:05:08.583
<font face="Comic Sans MS">Shouldn't you hide yourself?</font>

55
00:05:10.417 --> 00:05:11.500
<font face="Comic Sans MS">You interrupted my nap!</font>

56
00:05:11.542 --> 00:05:13.375
<font face="Comic Sans MS">Food comas are very uncomfortable!</font>

57
00:05:13.667 --> 00:05:16.542
<font face="Comic Sans MS">Robbing by day is for amateurs!</font>

58
00:05:17.458 --> 00:05:18.708
<font face="Comic Sans MS">Come back at night!</font>

59
00:05:24.958 --> 00:05:26.125
<font face="Comic Sans MS">I feel much better.</font>

60
00:05:41.708 --> 00:05:42.958
<font face="Comic Sans MS">Stay here.</font>

61
00:06:27.583 --> 00:06:29.583
<font face="Comic Sans MS">My arm is breaking!</font>

62
00:06:29.667 --> 00:06:32.667
<font face="Comic Sans MS">Spare us, Hero!</font>

63
00:06:41.083 --> 00:06:42.708
<font face="Comic Sans MS">Bad boys!</font>

64
00:06:53.250 --> 00:06:55.208
<font face="Comic Sans MS">Hey Boss, keep the change.</font>

65
00:07:06.708 --> 00:07:08.458
<font face="Comic Sans MS">Pigsy is amazing!</font>

66
00:07:10.333 --> 00:07:11.333
<font face="Comic Sans MS">For the noodles.</font>

67
00:07:14.458 --> 00:07:15.250
<font face="Comic Sans MS">Hero!</font>

68
00:07:16.250 --> 00:07:16.833
<font face="Comic Sans MS">Hero?</font>

69
00:07:17.208 --> 00:07:17.875
<font face="Comic Sans MS">Who?</font>

70
00:07:20.542 --> 00:07:21.500
<font face="Comic Sans MS">Thank you.</font>

71
00:07:21.833 --> 00:07:23.083
<font face="Comic Sans MS">Thank you for helping us.</font>

72
00:07:26.750 --> 00:07:28.125
<font face="Comic Sans MS">Girls sure are brazen these days.</font>

73
00:07:53.125 --> 00:07:53.875
<font face="Comic Sans MS">Mantou,</font>

74
00:07:54.500 --> 00:07:56.750
<font face="Comic Sans MS">He's not Pigsy after all.</font>

75
00:07:57.042 --> 00:07:58.375
<font face="Comic Sans MS">He's the Monkey King!</font>

76
00:08:13.833 --> 00:08:17.083
<font face="Comic Sans MS">In 1914, China was divided by many powers,</font>

77
00:08:17.125 --> 00:08:19.042
<font face="Comic Sans MS">And warlords battled one another.</font>

78
00:08:19.083 --> 00:08:22.042
<font face="Comic Sans MS">Cao Ying was the most vicious among them.</font>

79
00:08:22.083 --> 00:08:24.000
<font face="Comic Sans MS">His army spread fear through slaughter,</font>

80
00:08:24.083 --> 00:08:26.917
<font face="Comic Sans MS">and everywhere he conquered became hell on Earth.</font>

81
00:08:27.000 --> 00:08:29.917
<font face="Comic Sans MS">People fled for their lives,</font>

82
00:08:30.000 --> 00:08:32.333
<font face="Comic Sans MS">losing everything they had.</font>

83
00:08:55.708 --> 00:09:00.792
<font face="Comic Sans MS">Pucheng</font>

84
00:09:07.250 --> 00:09:08.583
<font face="Comic Sans MS">Sheriff Yang is back!</font>

85
00:09:10.333 --> 00:09:11.375
<font face="Comic Sans MS">Sheriff Yang!</font>

86
00:09:15.958 --> 00:09:16.750
<font face="Comic Sans MS">Sheriff!</font>

87
00:09:19.125 --> 00:09:20.167
<font face="Comic Sans MS">Sheriff is back!</font>

88
00:09:20.750 --> 00:09:21.542
<font face="Comic Sans MS">Daddy!</font>

89
00:09:21.750 --> 00:09:23.250
<font face="Comic Sans MS">Sheriff is back!</font>

90
00:09:27.833 --> 00:09:29.542
<font face="Comic Sans MS">Meal time!</font>

91
00:09:29.667 --> 00:09:30.708
<font face="Comic Sans MS">I'm starving.</font>

92
00:09:32.792 --> 00:09:34.250
<font face="Comic Sans MS">I have an announcement.</font>

93
00:09:34.750 --> 00:09:37.208
<font face="Comic Sans MS">Warlord Cao Ying's army has taken Stone City.</font>

94
00:09:37.458 --> 00:09:39.125
<font face="Comic Sans MS">Due to this military emergency, our troops</font>

95
00:09:39.167 --> 00:09:41.417
<font face="Comic Sans MS">have been transferred to the front lines.</font>

96
00:09:41.833 --> 00:09:43.500
<font face="Comic Sans MS">Pucheng won't have military protection.</font>

97
00:09:43.958 --> 00:09:45.042
<font face="Comic Sans MS">For now, they will rely on us, the guardians.</font>

98
00:09:48.583 --> 00:09:49.750
<font face="Comic Sans MS">The army has gone to war</font>

99
00:09:50.542 --> 00:09:52.417
<font face="Comic Sans MS">while we maintain order.</font>

100
00:09:52.958 --> 00:09:53.875
<font face="Comic Sans MS">That's fine!</font>

101
00:09:54.500 --> 00:09:56.583
<font face="Comic Sans MS">We have Sheriff Yang to lead us.</font>

102
00:09:56.792 --> 00:09:58.000
<font face="Comic Sans MS">Isn't that right?</font>

103
00:09:58.792 --> 00:09:59.208
<font face="Comic Sans MS">Yes?</font>

104
00:09:59.292 --> 00:10:00.042
<font face="Comic Sans MS">Let's eat!</font>

105
00:10:00.083 --> 00:10:01.708
<font face="Comic Sans MS">Time to eat!</font>

106
00:10:02.167 --> 00:10:03.083
<font face="Comic Sans MS">Eat up, Sheriff.</font>

107
00:10:03.208 --> 00:10:03.917
<font face="Comic Sans MS">Sheriff!</font>

108
00:10:04.500 --> 00:10:05.833
<font face="Comic Sans MS">There are many refugees at the gate.</font>

109
00:10:06.125 --> 00:10:07.542
<font face="Comic Sans MS">Our villagers won't let them in.</font>

110
00:10:07.750 --> 00:10:09.500
<font face="Comic Sans MS">They're kicking up a big fuss!</font>

111
00:10:12.042 --> 00:10:14.250
<font face="Comic Sans MS">Stand back, everyone!</font>

112
00:10:14.458 --> 00:10:15.917
<font face="Comic Sans MS">Calm down, don't push!</font>

113
00:10:17.167 --> 00:10:19.083
<font face="Comic Sans MS">Stand back!</font>

114
00:10:19.625 --> 00:10:20.375
<font face="Comic Sans MS">Don't crowd!</font>

115
00:10:20.417 --> 00:10:23.625
<font face="Comic Sans MS">No, there is no more room in the city!</font>

116
00:10:23.917 --> 00:10:24.875
<font face="Comic Sans MS">Calm down.</font>

117
00:10:24.917 --> 00:10:27.167
<font face="Comic Sans MS">Sir, we escaped from Stone City!</font>

118
00:10:27.208 --> 00:10:29.542
<font face="Comic Sans MS">The Cao Army took our houses!</font>

119
00:10:29.792 --> 00:10:31.542
<font face="Comic Sans MS">We are homeless now!</font>

120
00:10:31.583 --> 00:10:33.333
<font face="Comic Sans MS">Please take us in!</font>

121
00:10:33.583 --> 00:10:36.125
<font face="Comic Sans MS">Please, we beg you!</font>

122
00:10:39.750 --> 00:10:40.708
<font face="Comic Sans MS">Get up now...</font>

123
00:10:41.833 --> 00:10:43.167
<font face="Comic Sans MS">Listen to me.</font>

124
00:10:43.792 --> 00:10:48.000
<font face="Comic Sans MS">Can you bear to watch refugees wander and starve?</font>

125
00:10:50.250 --> 00:10:52.250
<font face="Comic Sans MS">Many of you aren't Pucheng natives</font>

126
00:10:52.292 --> 00:10:55.250
<font face="Comic Sans MS">And came during the famine 20 years ago</font>

127
00:10:56.500 --> 00:10:58.083
<font face="Comic Sans MS">We accepted you then</font>

128
00:10:58.125 --> 00:10:59.583
<font face="Comic Sans MS">And have lived well together.</font>

129
00:11:00.292 --> 00:11:00.875
<font face="Comic Sans MS">That's right!</font>

130
00:11:01.250 --> 00:11:02.000
<font face="Comic Sans MS">Think about it.</font>

131
00:11:02.458 --> 00:11:04.542
<font face="Comic Sans MS">If we Pucheng people were the ones in trouble,</font>

132
00:11:04.917 --> 00:11:06.083
<font face="Comic Sans MS">Wouldn't we also want</font>

133
00:11:06.167 --> 00:11:08.667
<font face="Comic Sans MS">a temporary place to stay?</font>

134
00:11:12.208 --> 00:11:13.625
<font face="Comic Sans MS">Let's obey the Sheriff!</font>

135
00:11:14.417 --> 00:11:15.708
<font face="Comic Sans MS">We'll help in any way we can.</font>

136
00:11:16.208 --> 00:11:17.167
<font face="Comic Sans MS">All right?</font>

137
00:11:17.667 --> 00:11:19.125
<font face="Comic Sans MS">Yes!</font>

138
00:11:20.458 --> 00:11:21.542
<font face="Comic Sans MS">I'll provide bread!</font>

139
00:11:21.750 --> 00:11:22.708
<font face="Comic Sans MS">Fellow villagers!</font>

140
00:11:22.917 --> 00:11:24.417
<font face="Comic Sans MS">Let's also help them!</font>

141
00:11:24.875 --> 00:11:26.292
<font face="Comic Sans MS">Some can stay at my home!</font>

142
00:11:26.333 --> 00:11:27.083
<font face="Comic Sans MS">Good!</font>

143
00:11:30.417 --> 00:11:32.000
<font face="Comic Sans MS">We'll help in any way we can!</font>

144
00:11:36.292 --> 00:11:37.000
<font face="Comic Sans MS">Cousin!</font>

145
00:11:41.167 --> 00:11:42.000
<font face="Comic Sans MS">Cousin!</font>

146
00:11:42.750 --> 00:11:43.417
<font face="Comic Sans MS">Cousin!</font>

147
00:11:44.083 --> 00:11:44.917
<font face="Comic Sans MS">Why are you...?</font>

148
00:11:44.958 --> 00:11:45.750
<font face="Comic Sans MS">Cousin!</font>

149
00:11:46.500 --> 00:11:48.083
<font face="Comic Sans MS">Let me take her.</font>

150
00:11:49.958 --> 00:11:54.375
<font face="Comic Sans MS">Cao soldiers charged into the school and</font>

151
00:11:55.292 --> 00:11:58.083
<font face="Comic Sans MS">killed many teachers and students</font>

152
00:11:58.667 --> 00:12:02.083
<font face="Comic Sans MS">because Cao Shaolun didn't like us reading.</font>

153
00:12:03.750 --> 00:12:05.417
<font face="Comic Sans MS">I saw Cao Shaolun when he killed.</font>

154
00:12:05.458 --> 00:12:06.875
<font face="Comic Sans MS">He looked like a demon!</font>

155
00:12:08.375 --> 00:12:11.458
<font face="Comic Sans MS">I was able to escape with some of the children.</font>

156
00:12:15.917 --> 00:12:18.083
<font face="Comic Sans MS">Teacher Bai, please settle here for now.</font>

157
00:12:19.042 --> 00:12:22.667
<font face="Comic Sans MS">We won't let ourselves be bullied.</font>

158
00:12:25.792 --> 00:12:26.958
<font face="Comic Sans MS">You'll be fine here.</font>

159
00:12:28.250 --> 00:12:29.292
<font face="Comic Sans MS">Once you're in Pucheng</font>

160
00:12:29.875 --> 00:12:30.708
<font face="Comic Sans MS">Have no fear!</font>

161
00:12:31.333 --> 00:12:33.625
<font face="Comic Sans MS">I'll take good care of you. Don't worry!</font>

162
00:12:40.208 --> 00:12:40.792
<font face="Comic Sans MS">Go take a look.</font>

163
00:13:02.250 --> 00:13:03.167
<font face="Comic Sans MS">Halt!</font>

164
00:13:03.708 --> 00:13:04.625
<font face="Comic Sans MS">What is your purpose here?</font>

165
00:13:04.875 --> 00:13:05.875
<font face="Comic Sans MS">Halt, halt!</font>

166
00:13:05.917 --> 00:13:07.042
<font face="Comic Sans MS">Crashing around like that;
do you have a deathwish?</font>

167
00:13:08.000 --> 00:13:08.958
<font face="Comic Sans MS">Are you deaf?</font>

168
00:13:09.583 --> 00:13:10.875
<font face="Comic Sans MS">They told you to stop!</font>

169
00:13:11.125 --> 00:13:12.167
<font face="Comic Sans MS">You ran into people!</font>

170
00:13:12.417 --> 00:13:13.500
<font face="Comic Sans MS">What are you up to?</font>

171
00:13:14.375 --> 00:13:15.708
<font face="Comic Sans MS">Your city's richest man</font>

172
00:13:15.750 --> 00:13:17.125
<font face="Comic Sans MS">Boss Liu invited us here!</font>

173
00:13:17.375 --> 00:13:18.542
<font face="Comic Sans MS">Out of our way!</font>

174
00:13:20.208 --> 00:13:22.417
<font face="Comic Sans MS">You look like you're up to no good.</font>

175
00:13:23.167 --> 00:13:24.542
<font face="Comic Sans MS">Let me tell you,</font>

176
00:13:24.583 --> 00:13:27.208
<font face="Comic Sans MS">Everyone who comes here must register.</font>

177
00:13:30.958 --> 00:13:32.333
<font face="Comic Sans MS">You forced me into this.</font>

178
00:13:32.375 --> 00:13:33.917
<font face="Comic Sans MS">You're just a small local guard!</font>

179
00:13:34.333 --> 00:13:35.417
<font face="Comic Sans MS">I'm Wang!</font>

180
00:13:35.458 --> 00:13:36.500
<font face="Comic Sans MS">Since this is our first visit,</font>

181
00:13:36.667 --> 00:13:38.667
<font face="Comic Sans MS">We will give you a show of force!</font>

182
00:13:38.708 --> 00:13:39.500
<font face="Comic Sans MS">Men!</font>

183
00:13:40.167 --> 00:13:40.750
<font face="Comic Sans MS">Don't help me!</font>

184
00:13:40.792 --> 00:13:41.792
<font face="Comic Sans MS">Yes!</font>

185
00:13:46.750 --> 00:13:47.958
<font face="Comic Sans MS">Yes!</font>

186
00:13:59.625 --> 00:14:01.125
<font face="Comic Sans MS">This move is called "Eat Dog Poop"!</font>

187
00:14:01.167 --> 00:14:02.292
<font face="Comic Sans MS">That's it?</font>

188
00:14:02.542 --> 00:14:03.375
<font face="Comic Sans MS">Are you all right?</font>

189
00:14:03.875 --> 00:14:05.583
<font face="Comic Sans MS">Of course I'm fine, get him!</font>

190
00:14:05.625 --> 00:14:06.125
<font face="Comic Sans MS">Yes, sir!</font>

191
00:14:21.458 --> 00:14:22.875
<font face="Comic Sans MS">Stop now!</font>

192
00:14:25.375 --> 00:14:26.458
<font face="Comic Sans MS">Boss Liu!</font>

193
00:14:28.417 --> 00:14:30.000
<font face="Comic Sans MS">Kenan, please don't misunderstand.</font>

194
00:14:30.042 --> 00:14:32.333
<font face="Comic Sans MS">Don't make it worse.</font>

195
00:14:32.667 --> 00:14:35.333
<font face="Comic Sans MS">These are protectors I have hired.</font>

196
00:14:35.958 --> 00:14:37.500
<font face="Comic Sans MS">That's right.</font>

197
00:14:37.542 --> 00:14:39.792
<font face="Comic Sans MS">The army has abandoned your city.</font>

198
00:14:39.833 --> 00:14:41.708
<font face="Comic Sans MS">Cao Ying's army might be here any minute.</font>

199
00:14:41.750 --> 00:14:43.333
<font face="Comic Sans MS">You know that, don't you?</font>

200
00:14:43.750 --> 00:14:45.667
<font face="Comic Sans MS">If not for visionary Boss Liu's</font>

201
00:14:45.708 --> 00:14:47.708
<font face="Comic Sans MS">Foresight to hire protectors,</font>

202
00:14:47.750 --> 00:14:49.208
<font face="Comic Sans MS">Who will be in charge of our safety?</font>

203
00:14:49.833 --> 00:14:51.292
<font face="Comic Sans MS">You guardians?</font>

204
00:14:51.333 --> 00:14:52.542
<font face="Comic Sans MS">The few of you?</font>

205
00:14:52.875 --> 00:14:55.000
<font face="Comic Sans MS">In real combat, what use are they?</font>

206
00:14:56.292 --> 00:14:57.333
<font face="Comic Sans MS">Sheriff Yang!</font>

207
00:14:57.792 --> 00:14:59.500
<font face="Comic Sans MS">Why did the army abandon us?</font>

208
00:14:59.542 --> 00:15:02.500
<font face="Comic Sans MS">Will the battle begin tomorrow?</font>

209
00:15:04.125 --> 00:15:05.125
<font face="Comic Sans MS">Listen to me!</font>

210
00:15:06.208 --> 00:15:07.875
<font face="Comic Sans MS">The army has just gone to the front lines.</font>

211
00:15:08.292 --> 00:15:09.708
<font face="Comic Sans MS">They did not abandon us.</font>

212
00:15:10.000 --> 00:15:11.250
<font face="Comic Sans MS">Don't worry!</font>

213
00:15:29.583 --> 00:15:30.875
<font face="Comic Sans MS">Monkey King!</font>

214
00:15:30.917 --> 00:15:32.583
<font face="Comic Sans MS">Monkey King?</font>

215
00:15:52.500 --> 00:15:53.958
<font face="Comic Sans MS">Taiping!</font>

216
00:15:54.583 --> 00:15:56.000
<font face="Comic Sans MS">Taiping---</font>

217
00:15:58.583 --> 00:16:01.500
<font face="Comic Sans MS">How many times have I asked you to wake me up?</font>

218
00:16:02.083 --> 00:16:03.333
<font face="Comic Sans MS">We've been through this!</font>

219
00:16:03.375 --> 00:16:05.250
<font face="Comic Sans MS">You know I'm a lazy pig!</font>

220
00:16:05.958 --> 00:16:07.333
<font face="Comic Sans MS">You want me to fall to my death?</font>

221
00:16:08.292 --> 00:16:09.667
<font face="Comic Sans MS">I won't buy you any food next time!</font>

222
00:16:14.083 --> 00:16:14.458
<font face="Comic Sans MS">All right.</font>

223
00:16:14.542 --> 00:16:15.375
<font face="Comic Sans MS">Stand down.</font>

224
00:16:16.875 --> 00:16:17.500
<font face="Comic Sans MS">Sure!</font>

225
00:16:17.917 --> 00:16:19.958
<font face="Comic Sans MS">Men, do what Boss Liu wants.</font>

226
00:16:20.333 --> 00:16:25.542
<font face="Comic Sans MS">Monkey King...</font>

227
00:16:26.958 --> 00:16:31.333
<font face="Comic Sans MS">Monkey King...</font>

228
00:16:31.417 --> 00:16:32.500
<font face="Comic Sans MS">Quiet!</font>

229
00:16:52.375 --> 00:16:52.958
<font face="Comic Sans MS">Let's go.</font>

230
00:16:57.333 --> 00:16:58.958
<font face="Comic Sans MS">Boss, trim my beard.</font>

231
00:16:59.333 --> 00:16:59.875
<font face="Comic Sans MS">Have a seat.</font>

232
00:16:59.917 --> 00:17:00.250
<font face="Comic Sans MS">Sure,</font>

233
00:17:00.292 --> 00:17:01.000
<font face="Comic Sans MS">Right away.</font>

234
00:17:23.542 --> 00:17:24.750
<font face="Comic Sans MS">What style do you want?</font>

235
00:17:25.500 --> 00:17:26.417
<font face="Comic Sans MS">Who are you?</font>

236
00:17:26.458 --> 00:17:27.583
<font face="Comic Sans MS">Seems that I don't know you.</font>

237
00:17:28.500 --> 00:17:30.750
<font face="Comic Sans MS">I am the Sheriff of Pucheng.</font>

238
00:17:32.875 --> 00:17:35.542
<font face="Comic Sans MS">Handlebar, short moustache, goatee...</font>

239
00:17:37.375 --> 00:17:38.333
<font face="Comic Sans MS">What style would you like?</font>

240
00:17:39.333 --> 00:17:41.583
<font face="Comic Sans MS">Do your best; I'm so handsome anyway.</font>

241
00:17:45.458 --> 00:17:47.833
<font face="Comic Sans MS">Miss Bai said you rescued the children.</font>

242
00:17:47.875 --> 00:17:50.000
<font face="Comic Sans MS">What is your purpose in Pucheng?</font>

243
00:17:50.250 --> 00:17:51.917
<font face="Comic Sans MS">I didn't choose to come.</font>

244
00:17:52.625 --> 00:17:54.625
<font face="Comic Sans MS">I go wherever Taiping wants me to.</font>

245
00:17:55.958 --> 00:17:56.917
<font face="Comic Sans MS">Taiping?</font>

246
00:17:57.167 --> 00:17:58.000
<font face="Comic Sans MS">My horse.</font>

247
00:17:59.125 --> 00:18:00.792
<font face="Comic Sans MS">What style are you going to out?</font>

248
00:18:01.333 --> 00:18:02.292
<font face="Comic Sans MS">I'm still thinking.</font>

249
00:18:04.375 --> 00:18:05.208
<font face="Comic Sans MS">What do you do?</font>

250
00:18:05.583 --> 00:18:06.917
<font face="Comic Sans MS">I'd also like to know.</font>

251
00:18:07.125 --> 00:18:08.750
<font face="Comic Sans MS">I have nothing to do today and tomorrow.</font>

252
00:18:09.875 --> 00:18:11.667
<font face="Comic Sans MS">Hey man, can you concentrate?</font>

253
00:18:11.750 --> 00:18:12.792
<font face="Comic Sans MS">Trim my beard.</font>

254
00:18:12.917 --> 00:18:15.625
<font face="Comic Sans MS">A wanderer... passing through here?</font>

255
00:18:17.000 --> 00:18:17.833
<font face="Comic Sans MS">When are you leaving?</font>

256
00:18:18.458 --> 00:18:19.625
<font face="Comic Sans MS">Ask Taiping.</font>

257
00:18:21.292 --> 00:18:22.417
<font face="Comic Sans MS">Anyideas?</font>

258
00:18:24.792 --> 00:18:25.583
<font face="Comic Sans MS">None yet.</font>

259
00:18:26.417 --> 00:18:27.542
<font face="Comic Sans MS">Let me ask you...</font>

260
00:18:27.833 --> 00:18:29.000
<font face="Comic Sans MS">How about handlebar mustache?</font>

261
00:18:29.042 --> 00:18:31.417
<font face="Comic Sans MS">Would it make me more handsome?</font>

262
00:18:32.042 --> 00:18:34.333
<font face="Comic Sans MS">You would look lecherous.</font>

263
00:18:35.083 --> 00:18:36.542
<font face="Comic Sans MS">Like a bad guy!</font>

264
00:18:38.458 --> 00:18:42.000
<font face="Comic Sans MS">How can you tell who is good or bad?</font>

265
00:18:42.500 --> 00:18:44.417
<font face="Comic Sans MS">Bad guys have no morals.</font>

266
00:18:45.792 --> 00:18:48.917
<font face="Comic Sans MS">Don't you believe in justice?</font>

267
00:18:48.958 --> 00:18:49.875
<font face="Comic Sans MS">Yes.</font>

268
00:18:51.167 --> 00:18:52.292
<font face="Comic Sans MS">But believing is not enough.</font>

269
00:18:53.292 --> 00:18:54.500
<font face="Comic Sans MS">It must be enforced.</font>

270
00:18:55.083 --> 00:18:57.417
<font face="Comic Sans MS">There can be no justice, without enforcement.</font>

271
00:18:57.750 --> 00:18:58.958
<font face="Comic Sans MS">I still don't know...</font>

272
00:18:59.000 --> 00:19:00.542
<font face="Comic Sans MS">Your name.</font>

273
00:19:00.625 --> 00:19:01.875
<font face="Comic Sans MS">I'm Yang Kenan.</font>

274
00:19:02.542 --> 00:19:03.875
<font face="Comic Sans MS">"Ke" as in kissing?</font>

275
00:19:04.000 --> 00:19:05.125
<font face="Comic Sans MS">"Nan" as in Nancy?</font>

276
00:19:07.792 --> 00:19:09.750
<font face="Comic Sans MS">"Ke" as in conquer, "nan" as in hardship.</font>

277
00:19:10.750 --> 00:19:11.542
<font face="Comic Sans MS">Honoured.</font>

278
00:19:12.583 --> 00:19:13.625
<font face="Comic Sans MS">I'm Ma Feng.</font>

279
00:19:16.500 --> 00:19:17.708
<font face="Comic Sans MS">The nation is in chaos,</font>

280
00:19:17.750 --> 00:19:19.292
<font face="Comic Sans MS">But not in Pucheng.</font>

281
00:19:19.500 --> 00:19:20.708
<font face="Comic Sans MS">You should leave soon.</font>

282
00:19:21.875 --> 00:19:23.000
<font face="Comic Sans MS">All I want is simple:</font>

283
00:19:23.542 --> 00:19:24.750
<font face="Comic Sans MS">"Taiping" (Peace).</font>

284
00:19:24.792 --> 00:19:26.500
<font face="Comic Sans MS">Just like your horse's name.</font>

285
00:19:29.333 --> 00:19:30.917
<font face="Comic Sans MS">Remember to register!</font>

286
00:19:32.250 --> 00:19:33.500
<font face="Comic Sans MS">You're done?</font>

287
00:19:34.000 --> 00:19:34.833
<font face="Comic Sans MS">How much?</font>

288
00:19:35.167 --> 00:19:36.833
<font face="Comic Sans MS">Depends on how happy you are!</font>

289
00:20:01.875 --> 00:20:02.875
<font face="Comic Sans MS">So handsome!</font>

290
00:20:27.583 --> 00:20:28.542
<font face="Comic Sans MS">Hero!</font>

291
00:20:37.583 --> 00:20:38.292
<font face="Comic Sans MS">Hero!</font>

292
00:20:40.583 --> 00:20:41.917
<font face="Comic Sans MS">Come on!</font>

293
00:20:42.875 --> 00:20:44.833
<font face="Comic Sans MS">Can't you let me sleep in peace?</font>

294
00:20:45.250 --> 00:20:46.333
<font face="Comic Sans MS">I'm sorry</font>

295
00:20:46.375 --> 00:20:47.833
<font face="Comic Sans MS">to interrupt your rest.</font>

296
00:20:48.708 --> 00:20:49.958
<font face="Comic Sans MS">We've met.</font>

297
00:20:50.375 --> 00:20:52.833
<font face="Comic Sans MS">It's late, but I came to ask you a favour.</font>

298
00:20:53.583 --> 00:20:55.292
<font face="Comic Sans MS">I'm Bai Ling, a teacher.</font>

299
00:20:56.083 --> 00:20:56.875
<font face="Comic Sans MS">Just stop!</font>

300
00:20:57.375 --> 00:20:58.708
<font face="Comic Sans MS">I know what you want.</font>

301
00:20:59.208 --> 00:21:00.583
<font face="Comic Sans MS">Let me tell you,</font>

302
00:21:01.083 --> 00:21:03.208
<font face="Comic Sans MS">I'm not a loose man.</font>

303
00:21:05.167 --> 00:21:06.375
<font face="Comic Sans MS">Don't misunderstand.</font>

304
00:21:07.167 --> 00:21:10.250
<font face="Comic Sans MS">I'm taking some orphans to the Capital.</font>

305
00:21:10.625 --> 00:21:12.500
<font face="Comic Sans MS">But the route is fraught with danger.</font>

306
00:21:12.542 --> 00:21:15.500
<font face="Comic Sans MS">I'd like to ask you to protect us on the way.</font>

307
00:21:18.708 --> 00:21:19.792
<font face="Comic Sans MS">Do you know me?</font>

308
00:21:21.083 --> 00:21:22.583
<font face="Comic Sans MS">What kind of person am I?</font>

309
00:21:23.333 --> 00:21:24.875
<font face="Comic Sans MS">I know you are a good man.</font>

310
00:21:28.792 --> 00:21:29.542
<font face="Comic Sans MS">Wrong!</font>

311
00:21:30.750 --> 00:21:33.667
<font face="Comic Sans MS">I do everything except what is good.</font>

312
00:21:33.708 --> 00:21:35.458
<font face="Comic Sans MS">Please go home.</font>

313
00:21:45.125 --> 00:21:45.958
<font face="Comic Sans MS">Hero!</font>

314
00:21:47.708 --> 00:21:49.167
<font face="Comic Sans MS">I beg you, please help them!</font>

315
00:21:49.417 --> 00:21:51.042
<font face="Comic Sans MS">Their parents have been murdered!</font>

316
00:21:51.333 --> 00:21:52.875
<font face="Comic Sans MS">Only you can guarantee their safety</font>

317
00:21:53.250 --> 00:21:54.958
<font face="Comic Sans MS">And bring them to their
relatives in the Capital...</font>

318
00:21:55.000 --> 00:21:57.125
<font face="Comic Sans MS">Can you please stop talking?</font>

319
00:21:57.167 --> 00:22:00.250
<font face="Comic Sans MS">Besides being a bad guy, I'm a very busy man!</font>

320
00:22:00.333 --> 00:22:01.875
<font face="Comic Sans MS">Do I look like I have nothing to do?</font>

321
00:22:02.875 --> 00:22:03.625
<font face="Comic Sans MS">Hero...</font>

322
00:22:03.708 --> 00:22:05.417
<font face="Comic Sans MS">Do you have money?</font>

323
00:22:05.833 --> 00:22:06.792
<font face="Comic Sans MS">Money...</font>

324
00:22:06.833 --> 00:22:07.458
<font face="Comic Sans MS">Yes!</font>

325
00:22:07.583 --> 00:22:09.250
<font face="Comic Sans MS">I'm a very bad, very busy man</font>

326
00:22:09.500 --> 00:22:11.000
<font face="Comic Sans MS">who loves money!</font>

327
00:22:11.167 --> 00:22:12.917
<font face="Comic Sans MS">I work for money, not for people.</font>

328
00:22:13.708 --> 00:22:15.708
<font face="Comic Sans MS">$100 Republic dollars, do you have it?</font>

329
00:22:16.625 --> 00:22:17.500
<font face="Comic Sans MS">A hundred?</font>

330
00:22:17.542 --> 00:22:18.625
<font face="Comic Sans MS">Do you have it?</font>

331
00:22:18.750 --> 00:22:20.375
<font face="Comic Sans MS">If you do, I can help you.</font>

332
00:22:28.000 --> 00:22:29.292
<font face="Comic Sans MS">I have an idea.</font>

333
00:22:29.333 --> 00:22:30.833
<font face="Comic Sans MS">See if you're interested.</font>

334
00:22:34.125 --> 00:22:36.667
<font face="Comic Sans MS">You actually don't look bad.</font>

335
00:22:36.875 --> 00:22:39.458
<font face="Comic Sans MS">If you get dressed up and made up</font>

336
00:22:39.792 --> 00:22:40.583
<font face="Comic Sans MS">you could be sold at a good price.</font>

337
00:22:40.625 --> 00:22:41.750
<font face="Comic Sans MS">I won't disturb you anymore.</font>

338
00:22:49.417 --> 00:22:51.417
<font face="Comic Sans MS">I know you want me to give up on this.</font>

339
00:22:52.500 --> 00:22:55.125
<font face="Comic Sans MS">Get some rest, good night.</font>

340
00:22:58.625 --> 00:22:59.667
<font face="Comic Sans MS">Teacher</font>

341
00:23:01.958 --> 00:23:04.833
<font face="Comic Sans MS">Why must you help those little urchins?</font>

342
00:23:29.042 --> 00:23:29.833
<font face="Comic Sans MS">Is she asleep?</font>

343
00:23:29.875 --> 00:23:30.667
<font face="Comic Sans MS">Yes.</font>

344
00:23:31.750 --> 00:23:32.667
<font face="Comic Sans MS">Look.</font>

345
00:23:35.000 --> 00:23:36.208
<font face="Comic Sans MS">That's you.</font>

346
00:23:36.583 --> 00:23:37.542
<font face="Comic Sans MS">The hairdo.</font>

347
00:23:37.708 --> 00:23:38.625
<font face="Comic Sans MS">Those eyebrows.</font>

348
00:23:38.667 --> 00:23:40.208
<font face="Comic Sans MS">Look, a hole.</font>

349
00:23:41.042 --> 00:23:42.875
<font face="Comic Sans MS">She has your eyebrows.</font>

350
00:24:39.167 --> 00:24:41.750
<font face="Comic Sans MS">Move those into the cart.</font>

351
00:24:42.167 --> 00:24:43.833
<font face="Comic Sans MS">We'll have some noodles and get going.</font>

352
00:24:50.500 --> 00:24:51.417
<font face="Comic Sans MS">Be careful!</font>

353
00:24:51.458 --> 00:24:52.458
<font face="Comic Sans MS">Take your time.</font>

354
00:24:52.917 --> 00:24:53.375
<font face="Comic Sans MS">Hurry!</font>

355
00:24:53.458 --> 00:24:54.083
<font face="Comic Sans MS">I'll put this here.</font>

356
00:24:54.125 --> 00:24:55.208
<font face="Comic Sans MS">Good.</font>

357
00:24:55.500 --> 00:24:56.500
<font face="Comic Sans MS">Go inside for noodles.</font>

358
00:24:56.542 --> 00:24:58.250
<font face="Comic Sans MS">Yes, let's eat.</font>

359
00:25:14.583 --> 00:25:15.750
<font face="Comic Sans MS">Good morning, sir!</font>

360
00:25:15.958 --> 00:25:18.792
<font face="Comic Sans MS">You're dressed to go hunting.</font>

361
00:25:19.167 --> 00:25:20.167
<font face="Comic Sans MS">Are you lost?</font>

362
00:25:20.500 --> 00:25:21.500
<font face="Comic Sans MS">Come in, have a seat.</font>

363
00:25:21.708 --> 00:25:23.708
<font face="Comic Sans MS">No one else is open yet.</font>

364
00:25:37.083 --> 00:25:38.125
<font face="Comic Sans MS">This way, please.</font>

365
00:25:47.500 --> 00:25:49.125
<font face="Comic Sans MS">We just opened, excuse the mess.</font>

366
00:25:49.167 --> 00:25:50.875
<font face="Comic Sans MS">The kid is sick, so I slept in a bit.</font>

367
00:25:50.917 --> 00:25:51.833
<font face="Comic Sans MS">Please sit down, sir.</font>

368
00:25:52.250 --> 00:25:53.458
<font face="Comic Sans MS">There are so many mountain trails</font>

369
00:25:53.500 --> 00:25:55.792
<font face="Comic Sans MS">so hunters always get lost around here.</font>

370
00:25:56.417 --> 00:25:58.250
<font face="Comic Sans MS">Where are you from?</font>

371
00:25:59.833 --> 00:26:01.417
<font face="Comic Sans MS">Did you come from Stone City?</font>

372
00:26:02.292 --> 00:26:03.625
<font face="Comic Sans MS">Really!</font>

373
00:26:03.958 --> 00:26:05.875
<font face="Comic Sans MS">You're so lucky to have escaped.</font>

374
00:26:06.250 --> 00:26:07.958
<font face="Comic Sans MS">Stone City must be hellish now,</font>

375
00:26:08.000 --> 00:26:09.333
<font face="Comic Sans MS">Being taken over by Cao.</font>

376
00:26:09.375 --> 00:26:10.792
<font face="Comic Sans MS">There's no peace there any more.</font>

377
00:26:11.333 --> 00:26:12.708
<font face="Comic Sans MS">That dog of a warlord!</font>

378
00:26:13.250 --> 00:26:14.458
<font face="Comic Sans MS">Dog of a warlord?</font>

379
00:26:14.500 --> 00:26:15.917
<font face="Comic Sans MS">Isn't Cao Ying a dog of a warlord?</font>

380
00:26:16.375 --> 00:26:17.542
<font face="Comic Sans MS">That dog of a warlord's bastard son,</font>

381
00:26:17.583 --> 00:26:18.875
<font face="Comic Sans MS">Cao Shaolun, is even more like a bastard!</font>

382
00:26:19.083 --> 00:26:20.542
<font face="Comic Sans MS">He's a beast among beasts!</font>

383
00:26:21.708 --> 00:26:23.208
<font face="Comic Sans MS">A beast among beasts?</font>

384
00:26:23.250 --> 00:26:24.542
<font face="Comic Sans MS">Do you have something against him?</font>

385
00:26:25.042 --> 00:26:25.792
<font face="Comic Sans MS">Yes.</font>

386
00:26:27.417 --> 00:26:29.125
<font face="Comic Sans MS">My cousin taught at Stone City.</font>

387
00:26:29.750 --> 00:26:31.792
<font face="Comic Sans MS">If it weren't for that cold-blooded killer,</font>

388
00:26:31.833 --> 00:26:33.125
<font face="Comic Sans MS">that inhuman Cao Shaolun,</font>

389
00:26:33.167 --> 00:26:34.833
<font face="Comic Sans MS">All those children wouldn't be orphaned!</font>

390
00:26:35.458 --> 00:26:36.708
<font face="Comic Sans MS">My cousin wouldn't suffer such hardship!</font>

391
00:26:38.625 --> 00:26:40.167
<font face="Comic Sans MS">Here comes my cousin now.</font>

392
00:26:40.208 --> 00:26:41.417
<font face="Comic Sans MS">If you don't believe me, ask her yourself!</font>

393
00:26:41.500 --> 00:26:43.375
<font face="Comic Sans MS">She watched the bastard commit murder!</font>

394
00:26:52.042 --> 00:26:53.083
<font face="Comic Sans MS">I, Li Tieniu, swear to</font>

395
00:26:53.375 --> 00:26:54.625
<font face="Comic Sans MS">Curse him all my life.</font>

396
00:26:55.042 --> 00:26:56.000
<font face="Comic Sans MS">May he go to hell when he dies!</font>

397
00:26:56.500 --> 00:26:57.875
<font face="Comic Sans MS">May he never be reincarnated!</font>

398
00:26:58.292 --> 00:26:59.125
<font face="Comic Sans MS">If he has a son,</font>

399
00:26:59.625 --> 00:27:00.917
<font face="Comic Sans MS">May he be cursed!</font>

400
00:27:01.208 --> 00:27:02.375
<font face="Comic Sans MS">Cousin, stop it!</font>

401
00:27:03.417 --> 00:27:04.750
<font face="Comic Sans MS">Let me talk to him.</font>

402
00:27:08.917 --> 00:27:10.167
<font face="Comic Sans MS">I'll make you some noodles!</font>

403
00:27:10.208 --> 00:27:11.500
<font face="Comic Sans MS">You must taste Tieniu's beef noodles.</font>

404
00:27:11.542 --> 00:27:12.250
<font face="Comic Sans MS">Sure.</font>

405
00:27:12.458 --> 00:27:13.917
<font face="Comic Sans MS">No scallions, please.</font>

406
00:27:18.500 --> 00:27:19.667
<font face="Comic Sans MS">You know me?</font>

407
00:27:24.417 --> 00:27:25.208
<font face="Comic Sans MS">I do.</font>

408
00:27:27.583 --> 00:27:28.958
<font face="Comic Sans MS">Come, have some tea.</font>

409
00:27:41.250 --> 00:27:43.292
<font face="Comic Sans MS">I beg you, let them go.</font>

410
00:27:44.833 --> 00:27:45.750
<font face="Comic Sans MS">Sit.</font>

411
00:27:49.792 --> 00:27:51.833
<font face="Comic Sans MS">Do I look like a murderer of innocents?</font>

412
00:28:02.208 --> 00:28:03.917
<font face="Comic Sans MS">Then I'm finished!</font>

413
00:28:04.875 --> 00:28:06.625
<font face="Comic Sans MS">If I have a son, will he really be cursed?</font>

414
00:28:07.042 --> 00:28:08.500
<font face="Comic Sans MS">What will happen if I have a daughter?</font>

415
00:28:09.542 --> 00:28:10.875
<font face="Comic Sans MS">What did I do wrong?</font>

416
00:28:12.000 --> 00:28:14.917
<font face="Comic Sans MS">We are ordinary people.</font>

417
00:28:15.417 --> 00:28:17.083
<font face="Comic Sans MS">We don't know each other!</font>

418
00:28:18.000 --> 00:28:19.750
<font face="Comic Sans MS">WhY do you kill people?</font>

419
00:28:20.042 --> 00:28:21.167
<font face="Comic Sans MS">Killing people is no big deal.</font>

420
00:28:21.625 --> 00:28:22.875
<font face="Comic Sans MS">I've been killing</font>

421
00:28:23.167 --> 00:28:24.542
<font face="Comic Sans MS">since I was 8.</font>

422
00:28:25.000 --> 00:28:26.708
<font face="Comic Sans MS">My father told me then,</font>

423
00:28:26.958 --> 00:28:28.583
<font face="Comic Sans MS">"Son, it's no problem!</font>

424
00:28:28.875 --> 00:28:30.625
<font face="Comic Sans MS">Kill whoever you want.</font>

425
00:28:30.667 --> 00:28:32.333
<font face="Comic Sans MS">You're Cao Ying's son."</font>

426
00:28:37.125 --> 00:28:38.500
<font face="Comic Sans MS">This is nonsense.</font>

427
00:28:39.875 --> 00:28:41.417
<font face="Comic Sans MS">You're a teacher and you</font>

428
00:28:41.458 --> 00:28:43.250
<font face="Comic Sans MS">don't understand such a simple fact?</font>

429
00:28:43.333 --> 00:28:44.917
<font face="Comic Sans MS">How can you teach the next generation?</font>

430
00:28:45.417 --> 00:28:47.708
<font face="Comic Sans MS">With brute power there is no justice.</font>

431
00:28:47.750 --> 00:28:50.292
<font face="Comic Sans MS">When you have power, others will fear you.</font>

432
00:28:51.208 --> 00:28:53.042
<font face="Comic Sans MS">Those who don't...</font>

433
00:28:56.125 --> 00:28:57.958
<font face="Comic Sans MS">Only meet with death.</font>

434
00:28:59.417 --> 00:29:00.958
<font face="Comic Sans MS">I'll play a game with you.</font>

435
00:29:01.458 --> 00:29:03.125
<font face="Comic Sans MS">If I lose I'll leave right away.</font>

436
00:29:04.250 --> 00:29:05.375
<font face="Comic Sans MS">If I win...</font>

437
00:29:05.958 --> 00:29:07.958
<font face="Comic Sans MS">You all must die.</font>

438
00:29:14.250 --> 00:29:15.583
<font face="Comic Sans MS">Let's bet on whether my noodles</font>

439
00:29:16.125 --> 00:29:17.917
<font face="Comic Sans MS">will come with scallions.</font>

440
00:29:25.333 --> 00:29:26.625
<font face="Comic Sans MS">You choose.</font>

441
00:29:28.917 --> 00:29:30.417
<font face="Comic Sans MS">No? Then I'll choose.</font>

442
00:29:31.500 --> 00:29:33.167
<font face="Comic Sans MS">Since he has been telling me off,</font>

443
00:29:34.417 --> 00:29:37.917
<font face="Comic Sans MS">I'm sure he's put a lot of scallions in it!</font>

444
00:29:54.042 --> 00:29:54.750
<font face="Comic Sans MS">Here you are, sir!</font>

445
00:29:55.125 --> 00:29:56.375
<font face="Comic Sans MS">Enjoy Tieniu's Beef Noodles</font>

446
00:29:56.458 --> 00:29:57.375
<font face="Comic Sans MS">while they're hot!</font>

447
00:30:21.083 --> 00:30:22.458
<font face="Comic Sans MS">I don't eat beef!</font>

448
00:30:29.417 --> 00:30:30.833
<font face="Comic Sans MS">Go see what's going on!</font>

449
00:30:52.042 --> 00:30:54.042
<font face="Comic Sans MS">Run, Dayuan!</font>

450
00:30:54.250 --> 00:30:55.333
<font face="Comic Sans MS">Dayuan!</font>

451
00:30:55.542 --> 00:30:56.500
<font face="Comic Sans MS">Run fast!</font>

452
00:30:56.542 --> 00:30:57.500
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>Teacher Bai!</i></font>

453
00:31:00.000 --> 00:31:00.583
<font face="Comic Sans MS">Look!</font>

454
00:31:00.667 --> 00:31:01.667
<font face="Comic Sans MS">Run fast!</font>

455
00:31:14.833 --> 00:31:16.667
<font face="Comic Sans MS">I'll kill you!</font>

456
00:31:17.750 --> 00:31:19.583
<font face="Comic Sans MS">I'll kill you,</font>

457
00:31:20.125 --> 00:31:21.875
<font face="Comic Sans MS">you demon!</font>

458
00:32:15.125 --> 00:32:17.000
<font face="Comic Sans MS">It's really not my fault!</font>

459
00:32:17.792 --> 00:32:18.458
<font face="Comic Sans MS">Hurry, go see!</font>

460
00:32:18.500 --> 00:32:19.458
<font face="Comic Sans MS">What was that?</font>

461
00:32:23.208 --> 00:32:24.125
<font face="Comic Sans MS">What's going on?</font>

462
00:32:24.500 --> 00:32:25.750
<font face="Comic Sans MS">What's going on?</font>

463
00:32:26.833 --> 00:32:30.583
<font face="Comic Sans MS">Teacher Bai...</font>

464
00:32:31.917 --> 00:32:33.750
<font face="Comic Sans MS">Teacher Bai...</font>

465
00:32:46.875 --> 00:32:48.917
<font face="Comic Sans MS">Murderer!</font>

466
00:32:58.917 --> 00:33:01.458
<font face="Comic Sans MS">Murderer, I'll fight you to the death!</font>

467
00:33:01.500 --> 00:33:03.250
<font face="Comic Sans MS">He must be punished!</font>

468
00:33:11.458 --> 00:33:13.708
<font face="Comic Sans MS">He's a killer, execute him!</font>

469
00:33:14.333 --> 00:33:16.333
<font face="Comic Sans MS">It should be done right here!</font>

470
00:33:17.833 --> 00:33:19.417
<font face="Comic Sans MS">Quiet, everyone!</font>

471
00:33:21.167 --> 00:33:22.333
<font face="Comic Sans MS">This man</font>

472
00:33:22.375 --> 00:33:24.958
<font face="Comic Sans MS">came to Pucheng and killed our Tieniu,</font>

473
00:33:25.833 --> 00:33:29.917
<font face="Comic Sans MS">A Stone City teacher, and a child today.</font>

474
00:33:30.667 --> 00:33:32.750
<font face="Comic Sans MS">Our governor has left the city</font>

475
00:33:33.333 --> 00:33:35.208
<font face="Comic Sans MS">So Sheriff Yang</font>

476
00:33:35.250 --> 00:33:38.833
<font face="Comic Sans MS">will be in charge of the murderer's trial.</font>

477
00:33:45.208 --> 00:33:46.458
<font face="Comic Sans MS">What is your name?</font>

478
00:33:46.500 --> 00:33:47.792
<font face="Comic Sans MS">Where did you come from?</font>

479
00:33:49.000 --> 00:33:50.625
<font face="Comic Sans MS">Why did you kill those three people?</font>

480
00:33:52.792 --> 00:33:54.625
<font face="Comic Sans MS">I just went in to eat noodles</font>

481
00:33:55.667 --> 00:33:57.708
<font face="Comic Sans MS">But the kid came and grabbed my gun!</font>

482
00:33:58.125 --> 00:33:59.583
<font face="Comic Sans MS">I was going to get it back</font>

483
00:34:00.542 --> 00:34:01.708
<font face="Comic Sans MS">but the gun went off!</font>

484
00:34:01.750 --> 00:34:03.625
<font face="Comic Sans MS">The boss came to beat me up.</font>

485
00:34:04.375 --> 00:34:05.750
<font face="Comic Sans MS">I asked him to stop, he didn't.</font>

486
00:34:06.167 --> 00:34:09.250
<font face="Comic Sans MS">I shot and killed him.</font>

487
00:34:09.625 --> 00:34:11.208
<font face="Comic Sans MS">I didn't mean to.</font>

488
00:34:11.792 --> 00:34:12.750
<font face="Comic Sans MS">Liar!</font>

489
00:34:13.708 --> 00:34:15.833
<font face="Comic Sans MS">You did it on purpose, stop arguing!</font>

490
00:34:20.542 --> 00:34:22.958
<font face="Comic Sans MS">So you killed all three of them?</font>

491
00:34:23.583 --> 00:34:25.083
<font face="Comic Sans MS">They were accidents.</font>

492
00:34:25.458 --> 00:34:27.333
<font face="Comic Sans MS">All three murders were accidents?</font>

493
00:34:32.625 --> 00:34:34.375
<font face="Comic Sans MS">You won't say your name</font>

494
00:34:34.750 --> 00:34:36.375
<font face="Comic Sans MS">Or where you're from.</font>

495
00:34:37.792 --> 00:34:39.625
<font face="Comic Sans MS">You're speaking only nonsense.</font>

496
00:34:40.667 --> 00:34:42.000
<font face="Comic Sans MS">Since you admit to the murders,</font>

497
00:34:42.750 --> 00:34:44.750
<font face="Comic Sans MS">As the Sheriff of Pucheng</font>

498
00:34:44.833 --> 00:34:46.333
<font face="Comic Sans MS">I must sentence you, the nameless, to death.</font>

499
00:34:47.167 --> 00:34:48.333
<font face="Comic Sans MS">Liao, summon the executioner.</font>

500
00:34:48.417 --> 00:34:49.583
<font face="Comic Sans MS">Yes, sir!</font>

501
00:34:50.667 --> 00:34:51.958
<font face="Comic Sans MS">According to the law,</font>

502
00:34:52.292 --> 00:34:55.250
<font face="Comic Sans MS">This man's dog of a head can be removed</font>

503
00:34:55.292 --> 00:34:56.375
<font face="Comic Sans MS">Early tomorrow morning.</font>

504
00:34:56.583 --> 00:34:59.208
<font face="Comic Sans MS">Hurrah...</font>

505
00:35:06.542 --> 00:35:07.292
<font face="Comic Sans MS">What's this?</font>

506
00:35:29.000 --> 00:35:29.958
<font face="Comic Sans MS">Halt!</font>

507
00:35:31.708 --> 00:35:32.708
<font face="Comic Sans MS">What is your purpose?</font>

508
00:35:33.167 --> 00:35:34.708
<font face="Comic Sans MS">I came to pick up Junior Commandant.</font>

509
00:35:34.750 --> 00:35:36.500
<font face="Comic Sans MS">What Junior Commandant? Go!</font>

510
00:35:41.167 --> 00:35:41.958
<font face="Comic Sans MS">Go now!</font>

511
00:36:08.917 --> 00:36:11.042
<font face="Comic Sans MS">Junior Commandant, I deserve to die</font>

512
00:36:11.083 --> 00:36:12.167
<font face="Comic Sans MS">For coming so late!</font>

513
00:36:14.042 --> 00:36:15.375
<font face="Comic Sans MS">Please spare us, Junior Commandant!</font>

514
00:36:25.500 --> 00:36:26.875
<font face="Comic Sans MS">Is everything all right?</font>

515
00:36:27.167 --> 00:36:29.750
<font face="Comic Sans MS">He is the son of General Cao Ying,</font>

516
00:36:29.792 --> 00:36:30.875
<font face="Comic Sans MS">Junior Commandant Cao!</font>

517
00:36:31.375 --> 00:36:32.958
<font face="Comic Sans MS">What? He's Cao Ying's son?</font>

518
00:36:40.333 --> 00:36:41.125
<font face="Comic Sans MS">Release him now!</font>

519
00:36:41.667 --> 00:36:43.167
<font face="Comic Sans MS">You're on my turf.</font>

520
00:36:43.208 --> 00:36:44.667
<font face="Comic Sans MS">You cannot demand his release.</font>

521
00:36:45.375 --> 00:36:46.792
<font face="Comic Sans MS">So what if Cao Ying is his father?</font>

522
00:36:47.625 --> 00:36:49.083
<font face="Comic Sans MS">He is a murderer.</font>

523
00:36:49.375 --> 00:36:50.458
<font face="Comic Sans MS">He will be executed tomorrow morning.</font>

524
00:36:51.458 --> 00:36:53.000
<font face="Comic Sans MS">My army will arrive tomorrow.</font>

525
00:36:53.958 --> 00:36:55.667
<font face="Comic Sans MS">When General Cao takes over Pucheng,</font>

526
00:36:56.083 --> 00:36:57.125
<font face="Comic Sans MS">We will be the law.</font>

527
00:36:58.000 --> 00:36:58.708
<font face="Comic Sans MS">Release him!</font>

528
00:37:00.375 --> 00:37:01.958
<font face="Comic Sans MS">We'll talk when you've fought your way in.</font>

529
00:37:02.833 --> 00:37:04.167
<font face="Comic Sans MS">If you dare to steal him away,</font>

530
00:37:05.167 --> 00:37:06.667
<font face="Comic Sans MS">I will execute him on the spot.</font>

531
00:37:06.708 --> 00:37:08.208
<font face="Comic Sans MS">Stop it, don't be reckless!</font>

532
00:37:08.542 --> 00:37:09.750
<font face="Comic Sans MS">Don't you dare!</font>

533
00:37:09.792 --> 00:37:10.875
<font face="Comic Sans MS">Try us.</font>

534
00:37:13.708 --> 00:37:15.042
<font face="Comic Sans MS">May I remind you,</font>

535
00:37:15.375 --> 00:37:16.458
<font face="Comic Sans MS">If he dies,</font>

536
00:37:17.500 --> 00:37:19.792
<font face="Comic Sans MS">The entire city will be buried with him!</font>

537
00:37:22.208 --> 00:37:23.375
<font face="Comic Sans MS">Colonel Zhang,</font>

538
00:37:23.667 --> 00:37:25.417
<font face="Comic Sans MS">Those who break the law must be punished.</font>

539
00:37:26.625 --> 00:37:28.917
<font face="Comic Sans MS">Even I, the Junior Commandant.</font>

540
00:37:32.708 --> 00:37:33.833
<font face="Comic Sans MS">Put down your guns!</font>

541
00:37:36.625 --> 00:37:37.625
<font face="Comic Sans MS">Go back.</font>

542
00:37:43.625 --> 00:37:44.875
<font face="Comic Sans MS">Yes, sir.</font>

543
00:37:49.958 --> 00:37:51.375
<font face="Comic Sans MS">You only have one day's time.</font>

544
00:37:57.958 --> 00:37:59.333
<font face="Comic Sans MS">Listen carefully!</font>

545
00:37:59.917 --> 00:38:01.000
<font face="Comic Sans MS">Tomorrow morning,</font>

546
00:38:01.375 --> 00:38:02.958
<font face="Comic Sans MS">I will lead the army into the city for him.</font>

547
00:38:03.917 --> 00:38:06.167
<font face="Comic Sans MS">If even a hair is missing on his head,</font>

548
00:38:07.042 --> 00:38:08.125
<font face="Comic Sans MS">This whole city</font>

549
00:38:08.500 --> 00:38:09.708
<font face="Comic Sans MS">will be covered with corpses</font>

550
00:38:10.375 --> 00:38:11.500
<font face="Comic Sans MS">And the rivers dyed red with blood!</font>

551
00:38:54.375 --> 00:38:56.042
<font face="Comic Sans MS">I'll play a game with you</font>

552
00:38:56.625 --> 00:38:57.875
<font face="Comic Sans MS">In one day,</font>

553
00:38:57.917 --> 00:39:00.625
<font face="Comic Sans MS">I want you to release me with your own hands.</font>

554
00:39:03.250 --> 00:39:03.917
<font face="Comic Sans MS">Lock him up!</font>

555
00:39:11.500 --> 00:39:13.958
<font face="Comic Sans MS">What do we do now?</font>

556
00:39:14.000 --> 00:39:15.292
<font face="Comic Sans MS">Everyone, don't worry.</font>

557
00:39:15.333 --> 00:39:16.125
<font face="Comic Sans MS">Calm down.</font>

558
00:39:16.167 --> 00:39:16.875
<font face="Comic Sans MS">Kenan!</font>

559
00:39:17.667 --> 00:39:18.625
<font face="Comic Sans MS">Kenan!</font>

560
00:39:18.667 --> 00:39:22.083
<font face="Comic Sans MS">I think we should probably let him go.</font>

561
00:39:22.750 --> 00:39:24.750
<font face="Comic Sans MS">He is Cao Ying's son...</font>

562
00:39:24.792 --> 00:39:26.542
<font face="Comic Sans MS">The Junior Commandant!</font>

563
00:39:27.042 --> 00:39:29.458
<font face="Comic Sans MS">If we kowtowed and apologized,</font>

564
00:39:29.708 --> 00:39:30.208
<font face="Comic Sans MS">Perhaps...</font>

565
00:39:30.250 --> 00:39:31.000
<font face="Comic Sans MS">No!</font>

566
00:39:31.542 --> 00:39:34.708
<font face="Comic Sans MS">He's a murderer who will be executed tomorrow!</font>

567
00:39:38.250 --> 00:39:40.583
<font face="Comic Sans MS">Since that is how you feel,</font>

568
00:39:40.625 --> 00:39:41.458
<font face="Comic Sans MS">Kenan,</font>

569
00:39:41.792 --> 00:39:43.167
<font face="Comic Sans MS">I'm not going to die</font>

570
00:39:43.375 --> 00:39:44.625
<font face="Comic Sans MS">with you.</font>

571
00:39:51.125 --> 00:39:52.500
<font face="Comic Sans MS">Out of the way!</font>

572
00:39:52.542 --> 00:39:53.500
<font face="Comic Sans MS">What are you looking at?</font>

573
00:39:53.542 --> 00:39:55.125
<font face="Comic Sans MS">Go home and wait to die!</font>

574
00:40:00.958 --> 00:40:03.125
<font face="Comic Sans MS">I'll notify the army to back us up.</font>

575
00:40:03.833 --> 00:40:04.917
<font face="Comic Sans MS">Don't worry,</font>

576
00:40:05.667 --> 00:40:06.792
<font face="Comic Sans MS">Go home now.</font>

577
00:40:22.500 --> 00:40:23.292
<font face="Comic Sans MS">Colonel,</font>

578
00:40:23.500 --> 00:40:24.917
<font face="Comic Sans MS">Why didn't we grab Junior Commandant?</font>

579
00:40:25.542 --> 00:40:27.917
<font face="Comic Sans MS">If anything goes wrong, we'll die.</font>

580
00:40:30.042 --> 00:40:32.292
<font face="Comic Sans MS">Don't you know what kind of man he is?</font>

581
00:40:33.833 --> 00:40:35.875
<font face="Comic Sans MS">If he's having fun he won't stop.</font>

582
00:40:37.417 --> 00:40:40.167
<font face="Comic Sans MS">If he wanted them dead
we would have killed them already.</font>

583
00:40:42.083 --> 00:40:44.875
<font face="Comic Sans MS">Besides we want to reign a city,</font>

584
00:40:44.917 --> 00:40:46.333
<font face="Comic Sans MS">Not destroy it.</font>

585
00:40:47.875 --> 00:40:49.583
<font face="Comic Sans MS">They won't harm Junior Commandant.</font>

586
00:40:51.917 --> 00:40:53.250
<font face="Comic Sans MS">Come with me tomorrow morning to get him.</font>

587
00:40:53.333 --> 00:40:54.000
<font face="Comic Sans MS">But...</font>

588
00:40:54.042 --> 00:40:55.000
<font face="Comic Sans MS">Say no more!</font>

589
00:40:57.833 --> 00:40:58.667
<font face="Comic Sans MS">Buhocks!</font>

590
00:40:59.667 --> 00:41:01.458
<font face="Comic Sans MS">He thinks he's Commander pet.</font>

591
00:41:01.750 --> 00:41:03.375
<font face="Comic Sans MS">If anything happens to Junior,</font>

592
00:41:04.125 --> 00:41:05.958
<font face="Comic Sans MS">We will be the ones to die, not he.</font>

593
00:41:06.125 --> 00:41:06.833
<font face="Comic Sans MS">Yes.</font>

594
00:41:07.167 --> 00:41:09.583
<font face="Comic Sans MS">What's so scary about local guardians?</font>

595
00:41:27.750 --> 00:41:29.292
<font face="Comic Sans MS">Are you leaving now?</font>

596
00:41:29.792 --> 00:41:31.750
<font face="Comic Sans MS">Why would I stay?</font>

597
00:41:39.375 --> 00:41:40.667
<font face="Comic Sans MS">Here is a letter.</font>

598
00:41:40.708 --> 00:41:42.917
<font face="Comic Sans MS">I found it among Miss Bai's things.</font>

599
00:41:43.375 --> 00:41:44.500
<font face="Comic Sans MS">Sorry,</font>

600
00:41:44.833 --> 00:41:46.875
<font face="Comic Sans MS">It didn't have an envelope, so I opened it.</font>

601
00:41:47.500 --> 00:41:48.875
<font face="Comic Sans MS">The letter is for you.</font>

602
00:41:59.458 --> 00:42:02.250
<font face="Comic Sans MS">The children are now with the Guardians.</font>

603
00:42:17.667 --> 00:42:18.417
<font face="Comic Sans MS">Hero,</font>

604
00:42:19.125 --> 00:42:21.375
<font face="Comic Sans MS">You've helped us before,</font>

605
00:42:21.417 --> 00:42:23.708
<font face="Comic Sans MS">So I know you have feelings.</font>

606
00:42:24.458 --> 00:42:27.583
<font face="Comic Sans MS">I didn't mean to interfere with your wanderings,</font>

607
00:42:28.542 --> 00:42:29.750
<font face="Comic Sans MS">But as a teacher</font>

608
00:42:30.292 --> 00:42:32.833
<font face="Comic Sans MS">I cannot leave my students in mortal danger.</font>

609
00:42:33.708 --> 00:42:36.625
<font face="Comic Sans MS">Unfortunately, I am weak and alone</font>

610
00:42:36.667 --> 00:42:37.875
<font face="Comic Sans MS">and unable to handle the prospect.</font>

611
00:42:38.417 --> 00:42:39.833
<font face="Comic Sans MS">I was desperate for a long time.</font>

612
00:42:39.875 --> 00:42:41.125
<font face="Comic Sans MS">I am writing this letter to you.</font>

613
00:42:41.917 --> 00:42:46.000
<font face="Comic Sans MS">Please take them safely to the Capital.</font>

614
00:42:47.042 --> 00:42:48.708
<font face="Comic Sans MS">I am willing to be your slave
for the rest of my life,</font>

615
00:42:49.250 --> 00:42:50.292
<font face="Comic Sans MS">Waiting on you hand and foot</font>

616
00:42:50.625 --> 00:42:51.917
<font face="Comic Sans MS">And doing all your bidding</font>

617
00:42:52.458 --> 00:42:54.875
<font face="Comic Sans MS">To make up for your $100 fee.</font>

618
00:42:56.042 --> 00:42:57.333
<font face="Comic Sans MS">Talk is cheap,</font>

619
00:42:57.708 --> 00:42:59.333
<font face="Comic Sans MS">So this letter shall serve as evidence</font>

620
00:43:00.125 --> 00:43:02.000
<font face="Comic Sans MS">Bai Ling bows to you.</font>

621
00:43:37.583 --> 00:43:38.542
<font face="Comic Sans MS">Sheriff,</font>

622
00:43:38.708 --> 00:43:40.417
<font face="Comic Sans MS">You have arrested the murderer for Bai Ling.</font>

623
00:43:41.167 --> 00:43:42.250
<font face="Comic Sans MS">I drink to you.</font>

624
00:43:43.208 --> 00:43:44.542
<font face="Comic Sans MS">I don't drink while on duty.</font>

625
00:43:45.833 --> 00:43:47.000
<font face="Comic Sans MS">Just one drink!</font>

626
00:43:48.958 --> 00:43:50.000
<font face="Comic Sans MS">I'll toast with tea.</font>

627
00:43:55.708 --> 00:43:56.708
<font face="Comic Sans MS">So stubborn!</font>

628
00:44:00.708 --> 00:44:03.292
<font face="Comic Sans MS">Let me ask you,</font>

629
00:44:05.375 --> 00:44:06.875
<font face="Comic Sans MS">This decision you made today...</font>

630
00:44:08.458 --> 00:44:10.583
<font face="Comic Sans MS">Aren't you afraid of harming your family?</font>

631
00:44:12.542 --> 00:44:13.708
<font face="Comic Sans MS">I am.</font>

632
00:44:14.500 --> 00:44:17.125
<font face="Comic Sans MS">And that's why I must not back down.</font>

633
00:44:24.750 --> 00:44:26.792
<font face="Comic Sans MS">The colonel who came today...</font>

634
00:44:28.833 --> 00:44:29.708
<font face="Comic Sans MS">We studied under the same Master.</font>

635
00:44:30.167 --> 00:44:31.000
<font face="Comic Sans MS">His name is Zhang Yi.</font>

636
00:44:31.542 --> 00:44:32.250
<font face="Comic Sans MS">He is</font>

637
00:44:32.333 --> 00:44:33.458
<font face="Comic Sans MS">a man of his word and</font>

638
00:44:33.500 --> 00:44:34.458
<font face="Comic Sans MS">a martial arts expert.</font>

639
00:44:34.875 --> 00:44:35.917
<font face="Comic Sans MS">You're no match for him.</font>

640
00:44:36.750 --> 00:44:37.875
<font face="Comic Sans MS">So what?</font>

641
00:44:38.667 --> 00:44:39.875
<font face="Comic Sans MS">Do you think I'll just give up like that?</font>

642
00:44:41.292 --> 00:44:42.875
<font face="Comic Sans MS">What about those 3 lives?</font>

643
00:44:44.042 --> 00:44:45.750
<font face="Comic Sans MS">Then why did you toast me earlier?</font>

644
00:44:48.958 --> 00:44:50.292
<font face="Comic Sans MS">One lives</font>

645
00:44:51.375 --> 00:44:52.542
<font face="Comic Sans MS">through one's conscience.</font>

646
00:45:12.792 --> 00:45:13.833
<font face="Comic Sans MS">I will bring the children</font>

647
00:45:14.625 --> 00:45:16.167
<font face="Comic Sans MS">to the Capital.</font>

648
00:45:17.875 --> 00:45:18.833
<font face="Comic Sans MS">You will?</font>

649
00:45:19.083 --> 00:45:19.750
<font face="Comic Sans MS">Yes.</font>

650
00:45:24.000 --> 00:45:24.958
<font face="Comic Sans MS">Because.</font>

651
00:45:25.042 --> 00:45:26.333
<font face="Comic Sans MS">One time, I received...</font>

652
00:45:26.583 --> 00:45:27.750
<font face="Comic Sans MS">a request I couldn't refuse.</font>

653
00:45:31.875 --> 00:45:32.875
<font face="Comic Sans MS">A test of one's conscience.</font>

654
00:45:34.292 --> 00:45:36.000
<font face="Comic Sans MS">I have to go out for a while, will be back soon.</font>

655
00:45:40.625 --> 00:45:44.542
<font face="Comic Sans MS">Be careful it doesn't catch fire!</font>

656
00:45:47.542 --> 00:45:51.583
<font face="Comic Sans MS">See that it doesn't catch fire!</font>

657
00:46:02.000 --> 00:46:02.792
<font face="Comic Sans MS">Don't you not want this?</font>

658
00:46:12.042 --> 00:46:13.250
<font face="Comic Sans MS">I see your forehead is dark,</font>

659
00:46:13.333 --> 00:46:15.000
<font face="Comic Sans MS">Nose hair is too long; ears stick out too much.</font>

660
00:46:15.583 --> 00:46:17.083
<font face="Comic Sans MS">You won't live past tonight.</font>

661
00:46:23.958 --> 00:46:25.083
<font face="Comic Sans MS">You don't believe me?</font>

662
00:46:27.792 --> 00:46:29.125
<font face="Comic Sans MS">Then never mind!</font>

663
00:46:48.417 --> 00:46:49.458
<font face="Comic Sans MS">Prison raid!</font>

664
00:47:15.542 --> 00:47:16.417
<font face="Comic Sans MS">Where is Junior Commandant?</font>

665
00:47:16.792 --> 00:47:17.792
<font face="Comic Sans MS">In hell!</font>

666
00:47:17.958 --> 00:47:18.917
<font face="Comic Sans MS">In hell?</font>

667
00:47:25.208 --> 00:47:25.833
<font face="Comic Sans MS">Guang!</font>

668
00:48:36.625 --> 00:48:37.917
<font face="Comic Sans MS">Release Junior Commandant!</font>

669
00:49:34.375 --> 00:49:35.042
<font face="Comic Sans MS">Shun!</font>

670
00:50:21.833 --> 00:50:22.458
<font face="Comic Sans MS">What is it?</font>

671
00:50:22.542 --> 00:50:24.000
<font face="Comic Sans MS">They are coming to raid the prison!</font>

672
00:50:28.625 --> 00:50:29.333
<font face="Comic Sans MS">Let's</font>

673
00:50:42.667 --> 00:50:43.500
<font face="Comic Sans MS">Don't go after them!</font>

674
00:50:43.542 --> 00:50:44.833
<font face="Comic Sans MS">Save Guang first!</font>

675
00:50:48.583 --> 00:50:50.125
<font face="Comic Sans MS">Guang!</font>

676
00:50:53.875 --> 00:50:55.333
<font face="Comic Sans MS">Guang!</font>

677
00:51:17.500 --> 00:51:18.083
<font face="Comic Sans MS">I'm going to kill him!</font>

678
00:51:18.125 --> 00:51:18.958
<font face="Comic Sans MS">Zhang Wu!</font>

679
00:51:23.583 --> 00:51:24.667
<font face="Comic Sans MS">Wu!</font>

680
00:52:04.208 --> 00:52:06.125
<font face="Comic Sans MS">Let him down now!</font>

681
00:52:06.792 --> 00:52:07.333
<font face="Comic Sans MS">Now!</font>

682
00:52:09.083 --> 00:52:10.125
<font face="Comic Sans MS">Lift him up!</font>

683
00:52:10.167 --> 00:52:11.042
<font face="Comic Sans MS">Let him down, quickly!</font>

684
00:52:12.042 --> 00:52:13.250
<font face="Comic Sans MS">He cannot die!</font>

685
00:52:13.542 --> 00:52:14.625
<font face="Comic Sans MS">Down!</font>

686
00:52:16.458 --> 00:52:18.917
<font face="Comic Sans MS">Wake up... you can't die!</font>

687
00:52:18.958 --> 00:52:20.292
<font face="Comic Sans MS">Wake up!</font>

688
00:52:30.417 --> 00:52:31.708
<font face="Comic Sans MS">So now I can't die?</font>

689
00:52:34.792 --> 00:52:37.042
<font face="Comic Sans MS">That look on your face...</font>

690
00:52:46.708 --> 00:52:48.875
<font face="Comic Sans MS">Why the hurry to hang yourself?</font>

691
00:52:48.917 --> 00:52:50.792
<font face="Comic Sans MS">I would have granted your wish tomorrow.</font>

692
00:52:56.917 --> 00:52:57.750
<font face="Comic Sans MS">Tomorrow</font>

693
00:52:57.833 --> 00:52:59.917
<font face="Comic Sans MS">At least half the people here will die.</font>

694
00:53:13.583 --> 00:53:14.250
<font face="Comic Sans MS">Halt!</font>

695
00:53:14.500 --> 00:53:15.500
<font face="Comic Sans MS">Who are you?</font>

696
00:53:18.583 --> 00:53:19.375
<font face="Comic Sans MS">Colonel,</font>

697
00:53:19.458 --> 00:53:20.625
<font face="Comic Sans MS">You have a visitor outside the tent.</font>

698
00:53:21.125 --> 00:53:21.792
<font face="Comic Sans MS">Bring him in.</font>

699
00:53:22.167 --> 00:53:22.708
<font face="Comic Sans MS">Yes, sir.</font>

700
00:53:53.958 --> 00:53:54.667
<font face="Comic Sans MS">Yi.</font>

701
00:54:10.333 --> 00:54:11.125
<font face="Comic Sans MS">It seems</font>

702
00:54:12.500 --> 00:54:14.208
<font face="Comic Sans MS">You have been very free these years.</font>

703
00:54:14.667 --> 00:54:15.542
<font face="Comic Sans MS">It's been all right.</font>

704
00:54:19.667 --> 00:54:21.417
<font face="Comic Sans MS">The facial hair</font>

705
00:54:22.458 --> 00:54:23.292
<font face="Comic Sans MS">suits you.</font>

706
00:54:23.917 --> 00:54:24.833
<font face="Comic Sans MS">Thank you.</font>

707
00:54:25.542 --> 00:54:28.083
<font face="Comic Sans MS">I can win on looks if not by fighting.</font>

708
00:54:28.708 --> 00:54:29.708
<font face="Comic Sans MS">Shameless!</font>

709
00:54:29.792 --> 00:54:30.792
<font face="Comic Sans MS">You don't believe me?</font>

710
00:54:31.542 --> 00:54:32.750
<font face="Comic Sans MS">Wanna try and see?</font>

711
00:54:35.833 --> 00:54:36.833
<font face="Comic Sans MS">Try and see?</font>

712
00:54:38.542 --> 00:54:40.833
<font face="Comic Sans MS">No one has dared to speak to me like this!</font>

713
00:54:41.417 --> 00:54:42.208
<font face="Comic Sans MS">You're bold.</font>

714
00:54:42.250 --> 00:54:43.375
<font face="Comic Sans MS">Of course.</font>

715
00:54:43.417 --> 00:54:46.208
<font face="Comic Sans MS">You're now the high and mighty</font>

716
00:54:46.292 --> 00:54:47.292
<font face="Comic Sans MS">Colonel Zhang.</font>

717
00:54:48.000 --> 00:54:49.750
<font face="Comic Sans MS">Who would dare to joke with you?</font>

718
00:54:52.500 --> 00:54:54.625
<font face="Comic Sans MS">Look at these two dragons.</font>

719
00:54:55.583 --> 00:54:57.458
<font face="Comic Sans MS">You've achieved your goal.</font>

720
00:54:59.000 --> 00:55:00.958
<font face="Comic Sans MS">This is just the start.</font>

721
00:55:01.667 --> 00:55:03.250
<font face="Comic Sans MS">I want to go further.</font>

722
00:55:04.458 --> 00:55:05.375
<font face="Comic Sans MS">Congratuations.</font>

723
00:55:06.375 --> 00:55:07.000
<font face="Comic Sans MS">And you?</font>

724
00:55:07.458 --> 00:55:08.708
<font face="Comic Sans MS">Your grand wanderings...</font>

725
00:55:09.042 --> 00:55:10.042
<font face="Comic Sans MS">How are they going?</font>

726
00:55:10.958 --> 00:55:12.458
<font face="Comic Sans MS">I just started.</font>

727
00:55:13.167 --> 00:55:14.667
<font face="Comic Sans MS">I want to see how far I will go.</font>

728
00:55:15.208 --> 00:55:17.208
<font face="Comic Sans MS">I already asked you to make a new world with me.</font>

729
00:55:17.250 --> 00:55:18.333
<font face="Comic Sans MS">But you wouldn't listen.</font>

730
00:55:18.375 --> 00:55:19.500
<font face="Comic Sans MS">Come work for me.</font>

731
00:55:20.833 --> 00:55:22.167
<font face="Comic Sans MS">Work for you?</font>

732
00:55:22.792 --> 00:55:23.917
<font face="Comic Sans MS">Doing what?</font>

733
00:55:24.042 --> 00:55:25.250
<font face="Comic Sans MS">Be a battalion commander for now.</font>

734
00:55:25.792 --> 00:55:27.250
<font face="Comic Sans MS">After a few battles,</font>

735
00:55:27.417 --> 00:55:28.583
<font face="Comic Sans MS">I will give you</font>

736
00:55:28.750 --> 00:55:29.833
<font face="Comic Sans MS">My rank of colonel.</font>

737
00:55:30.125 --> 00:55:31.375
<font face="Comic Sans MS">Battalion Commander sounds good.</font>

738
00:55:33.542 --> 00:55:34.667
<font face="Comic Sans MS">Battalion Commander...</font>

739
00:55:35.750 --> 00:55:37.292
<font face="Comic Sans MS">Does a battalion commander have to...</font>

740
00:55:37.375 --> 00:55:38.583
<font face="Comic Sans MS">Fight and kill</font>

741
00:55:39.625 --> 00:55:41.125
<font face="Comic Sans MS">From here...</font>

742
00:55:41.167 --> 00:55:42.583
<font face="Comic Sans MS">To here</font>

743
00:55:43.042 --> 00:55:45.667
<font face="Comic Sans MS">And then to here...</font>

744
00:55:46.667 --> 00:55:48.042
<font face="Comic Sans MS">Pucheng.</font>

745
00:55:48.625 --> 00:55:49.750
<font face="Comic Sans MS">Speaking of Pucheng,</font>

746
00:55:50.375 --> 00:55:52.208
<font face="Comic Sans MS">I pity the residents there.</font>

747
00:55:52.792 --> 00:55:54.875
<font face="Comic Sans MS">They'll all be dead tomorrow, right?</font>

748
00:56:02.792 --> 00:56:03.750
<font face="Comic Sans MS">I've already said</font>

749
00:56:04.125 --> 00:56:05.417
<font face="Comic Sans MS">To let the Junior Commandant go,</font>

750
00:56:05.667 --> 00:56:08.000
<font face="Comic Sans MS">And Pucheng residents will be unscathed.</font>

751
00:56:09.958 --> 00:56:11.875
<font face="Comic Sans MS">That Junior Commander of yours is a murderer!</font>

752
00:56:12.458 --> 00:56:13.750
<font face="Comic Sans MS">He killed three people.</font>

753
00:56:14.458 --> 00:56:15.417
<font face="Comic Sans MS">Two adults</font>

754
00:56:15.792 --> 00:56:18.208
<font face="Comic Sans MS">and an innocent child.</font>

755
00:56:18.250 --> 00:56:19.708
<font face="Comic Sans MS">Forget about 3 people!</font>

756
00:56:20.875 --> 00:56:22.250
<font face="Comic Sans MS">Even if he killed 300 people</font>

757
00:56:22.292 --> 00:56:23.458
<font face="Comic Sans MS">I must protect him!</font>

758
00:56:23.500 --> 00:56:24.625
<font face="Comic Sans MS">It's my job.</font>

759
00:56:26.667 --> 00:56:28.708
<font face="Comic Sans MS">I just don't want to see innocent people die.</font>

760
00:56:29.000 --> 00:56:29.792
<font face="Comic Sans MS">Exactly.</font>

761
00:56:30.667 --> 00:56:33.458
<font face="Comic Sans MS">Neither do I, so</font>

762
00:56:33.792 --> 00:56:35.458
<font face="Comic Sans MS">I'm giving them one day's time.</font>

763
00:56:36.583 --> 00:56:37.708
<font face="Comic Sans MS">Shall we take the side of justice...</font>

764
00:56:37.750 --> 00:56:39.333
<font face="Comic Sans MS">Don't talk to me about justice!</font>

765
00:56:39.625 --> 00:56:41.750
<font face="Comic Sans MS">Have you forgotten you ruined our business?</font>

766
00:56:41.958 --> 00:56:43.500
<font face="Comic Sans MS">Because of what you thought was justice,</font>

767
00:56:43.833 --> 00:56:45.833
<font face="Comic Sans MS">That dog of an official burned down our business!</font>

768
00:56:46.333 --> 00:56:47.667
<font face="Comic Sans MS">Our men became homeless,</font>

769
00:56:47.708 --> 00:56:48.875
<font face="Comic Sans MS">And many died or were injured.</font>

770
00:56:48.958 --> 00:56:50.750
<font face="Comic Sans MS">Have you forgotten that already?</font>

771
00:56:56.417 --> 00:56:57.708
<font face="Comic Sans MS">I remember.</font>

772
00:57:18.083 --> 00:57:19.375
<font face="Comic Sans MS">Do you have a deathwish?</font>

773
00:57:19.417 --> 00:57:21.708
<font face="Comic Sans MS">Robbing us with no martial arts skills.</font>

774
00:57:22.333 --> 00:57:23.667
<font face="Comic Sans MS">I'm not robbing you.</font>

775
00:57:24.000 --> 00:57:25.167
<font face="Comic Sans MS">Gods!</font>

776
00:57:26.125 --> 00:57:28.000
<font face="Comic Sans MS">Do you not have a sense of justice?</font>

777
00:57:28.375 --> 00:57:29.542
<font face="Comic Sans MS">That dog of an official</font>

778
00:57:29.750 --> 00:57:31.375
<font face="Comic Sans MS">Cheated me out of my money,</font>

779
00:57:31.792 --> 00:57:33.500
<font face="Comic Sans MS">Killed my parents,</font>

780
00:57:34.042 --> 00:57:35.958
<font face="Comic Sans MS">Took my wife...</font>

781
00:57:36.333 --> 00:57:38.833
<font face="Comic Sans MS">Give me back my wife!</font>

782
00:57:39.208 --> 00:57:40.125
<font face="Comic Sans MS">You dog of an official!</font>

783
00:57:40.417 --> 00:57:42.417
<font face="Comic Sans MS">Even if I fail in revenge,</font>

784
00:57:42.708 --> 00:57:45.250
<font face="Comic Sans MS">I will haunt you after my death!</font>

785
00:57:47.833 --> 00:57:49.500
<font face="Comic Sans MS">You can still escape now.</font>

786
00:57:54.917 --> 00:57:56.208
<font face="Comic Sans MS">Husband!</font>

787
00:58:00.875 --> 00:58:01.542
<font face="Comic Sans MS">Husband!</font>

788
00:58:01.750 --> 00:58:02.833
<font face="Comic Sans MS">Wife!</font>

789
00:58:03.292 --> 00:58:04.250
<font face="Comic Sans MS">Dog of an official!</font>

790
00:58:04.375 --> 00:58:05.917
<font face="Comic Sans MS">I'm going to kill you!</font>

791
00:58:06.167 --> 00:58:07.500
<font face="Comic Sans MS">Yi, ignore him.</font>

792
00:58:18.417 --> 00:58:19.417
<font face="Comic Sans MS">Scumbag!</font>

793
00:58:21.958 --> 00:58:23.125
<font face="Comic Sans MS">You may not kill him!</font>

794
00:58:27.750 --> 00:58:28.708
<font face="Comic Sans MS">You're crazy!</font>

795
00:58:29.542 --> 00:58:30.667
<font face="Comic Sans MS">If we escort him safely, the guards live.</font>

796
00:58:31.125 --> 00:58:32.458
<font face="Comic Sans MS">If not, the guards die.</font>

797
00:58:32.958 --> 00:58:35.333
<font face="Comic Sans MS">So we guards can ignore right from wrong</font>

798
00:58:37.042 --> 00:58:39.333
<font face="Comic Sans MS">And let this scumbag go free?</font>

799
00:58:41.208 --> 00:58:42.583
<font face="Comic Sans MS">If you kill him,</font>

800
00:58:43.250 --> 00:58:45.292
<font face="Comic Sans MS">over 300 of us in the company</font>

801
00:58:46.083 --> 00:58:47.208
<font face="Comic Sans MS">Will die!</font>

802
00:58:58.583 --> 00:58:59.625
<font face="Comic Sans MS">Feflg</font>

803
00:59:00.500 --> 00:59:01.917
<font face="Comic Sans MS">That is reality.</font>

804
00:59:20.333 --> 00:59:22.333
<font face="Comic Sans MS">Brute force beats reason every time</font>

805
00:59:41.042 --> 00:59:42.417
<font face="Comic Sans MS">What results from this reality?</font>

806
00:59:42.833 --> 00:59:45.625
<font face="Comic Sans MS">Those bastard officials always demand payback.</font>

807
00:59:46.167 --> 00:59:48.125
<font face="Comic Sans MS">If you still consider me your senior classmate,</font>

808
00:59:49.500 --> 00:59:50.958
<font face="Comic Sans MS">Do not be my enemy.</font>

809
00:59:57.792 --> 00:59:59.292
<font face="Comic Sans MS">Thanks for the egg.</font>

810
01:00:02.917 --> 01:00:03.667
<font face="Comic Sans MS">Feng!</font>

811
01:00:05.875 --> 01:00:07.333
<font face="Comic Sans MS">Ask them to release him.</font>

812
01:00:30.708 --> 01:00:32.458
<font face="Comic Sans MS">Junior Commandant...</font>

813
01:00:32.500 --> 01:00:33.458
<font face="Comic Sans MS">I'm Ma Feng.</font>

814
01:00:33.500 --> 01:00:35.167
<font face="Comic Sans MS">Here to rescue you under Colonel Zhang's orders!</font>

815
01:00:46.625 --> 01:00:47.667
<font face="Comic Sans MS">So, sir?</font>

816
01:00:48.000 --> 01:00:49.083
<font face="Comic Sans MS">I have a question.</font>

817
01:00:49.125 --> 01:00:50.458
<font face="Comic Sans MS">Please don't mind, I'm just curious.</font>

818
01:00:51.417 --> 01:00:52.333
<font face="Comic Sans MS">So...</font>

819
01:00:52.417 --> 01:00:53.667
<font face="Comic Sans MS">After you get out,</font>

820
01:00:54.083 --> 01:00:55.958
<font face="Comic Sans MS">What will you do?</font>

821
01:00:56.500 --> 01:00:58.000
<font face="Comic Sans MS">Will you spare the people of Pucheng?</font>

822
01:01:06.208 --> 01:01:07.208
<font face="Comic Sans MS">You think I'm an idiot?</font>

823
01:01:07.583 --> 01:01:08.750
<font face="Comic Sans MS">After all that killing,</font>

824
01:01:09.083 --> 01:01:10.292
<font face="Comic Sans MS">Your clothes are still white,</font>

825
01:01:11.375 --> 01:01:12.958
<font face="Comic Sans MS">But your heart is definitely black.</font>

826
01:01:14.042 --> 01:01:14.958
<font face="Comic Sans MS">Are you letting me go?</font>

827
01:01:16.333 --> 01:01:17.833
<font face="Comic Sans MS">Yet another dog of an official!</font>

828
01:01:50.625 --> 01:01:53.958
<font face="Comic Sans MS">He seems to mean for you to free him.</font>

829
01:01:57.833 --> 01:01:59.333
<font face="Comic Sans MS">Now you understand.</font>

830
01:02:02.167 --> 01:02:04.292
<font face="Comic Sans MS">He's not worried if we'll let him go,</font>

831
01:02:11.042 --> 01:02:12.625
<font face="Comic Sans MS">He just loves to kill.</font>

832
01:02:13.083 --> 01:02:14.708
<font face="Comic Sans MS">If we let him go now,</font>

833
01:02:15.417 --> 01:02:17.792
<font face="Comic Sans MS">We'd be giving him our lives unconditionally.</font>

834
01:02:19.458 --> 01:02:21.417
<font face="Comic Sans MS">I hope the army will win on the front lines</font>

835
01:02:21.458 --> 01:02:22.583
<font face="Comic Sans MS">And return soon.</font>

836
01:02:23.083 --> 01:02:24.917
<font face="Comic Sans MS">Only then will Pucheng's people be rescued.</font>

837
01:02:25.625 --> 01:02:26.917
<font face="Comic Sans MS">Such crystal-clear vision!</font>

838
01:02:27.625 --> 01:02:29.000
<font face="Comic Sans MS">But you will die, with or without</font>

839
01:02:29.042 --> 01:02:30.958
<font face="Comic Sans MS">clear vision.</font>

840
01:02:31.750 --> 01:02:32.792
<font face="Comic Sans MS">It will be dawn soon.</font>

841
01:02:37.500 --> 01:02:38.958
<font face="Comic Sans MS">I don't know you,</font>

842
01:02:40.208 --> 01:02:42.625
<font face="Comic Sans MS">But if you want to play a game</font>

843
01:02:42.667 --> 01:02:44.208
<font face="Comic Sans MS">I'll join you.</font>

844
01:03:15.292 --> 01:03:18.042
<font face="Comic Sans MS">Liao, you're here.</font>

845
01:03:32.708 --> 01:03:33.458
<font face="Comic Sans MS">Liao,</font>

846
01:03:34.750 --> 01:03:36.583
<font face="Comic Sans MS">Bao said you needed to see me urgently.</font>

847
01:03:36.625 --> 01:03:37.417
<font face="Comic Sans MS">What is it?</font>

848
01:03:37.458 --> 01:03:38.042
<font face="Comic Sans MS">Yes...</font>

849
01:03:39.458 --> 01:03:40.333
<font face="Comic Sans MS">Come with me.</font>

850
01:03:40.375 --> 01:03:40.875
<font face="Comic Sans MS">Where to?</font>

851
01:03:41.208 --> 01:03:42.500
<font face="Comic Sans MS">Let's talk as we walk.</font>

852
01:03:50.750 --> 01:03:52.000
<font face="Comic Sans MS">So much has happened today.</font>

853
01:03:52.042 --> 01:03:53.042
<font face="Comic Sans MS">I'll bet you haven't eaten.</font>

854
01:03:53.083 --> 01:03:54.125
<font face="Comic Sans MS">Have a pastry.</font>

855
01:03:56.417 --> 01:03:58.125
<font face="Comic Sans MS">Why are you so secretive?</font>

856
01:03:58.958 --> 01:04:00.583
<font face="Comic Sans MS">No, let's go.</font>

857
01:04:02.250 --> 01:04:03.250
<font face="Comic Sans MS">In all the years I've known you,</font>

858
01:04:04.375 --> 01:04:06.458
<font face="Comic Sans MS">Your stomach aches when you're nervous.</font>

859
01:04:08.500 --> 01:04:09.875
<font face="Comic Sans MS">What is it?</font>

860
01:04:13.792 --> 01:04:15.292
<font face="Comic Sans MS">Boss Liu wants to talk to you.</font>

861
01:04:16.125 --> 01:04:18.958
<font face="Comic Sans MS">He has a way to resolve this crisis.</font>

862
01:04:28.750 --> 01:04:30.375
<font face="Comic Sans MS">When did you meet with him?</font>

863
01:04:31.500 --> 01:04:32.875
<font face="Comic Sans MS">His idea is</font>

864
01:04:33.417 --> 01:04:35.125
<font face="Comic Sans MS">for me to release Cao Shaolun?</font>

865
01:04:36.208 --> 01:04:37.667
<font face="Comic Sans MS">You wouldn't believe him, would you?</font>

866
01:04:39.750 --> 01:04:41.083
<font face="Comic Sans MS">Trust me this once.</font>

867
01:04:42.125 --> 01:04:44.750
<font face="Comic Sans MS">We've risked our lives together all these years.</font>

868
01:04:44.958 --> 01:04:47.375
<font face="Comic Sans MS">Everything I do is for your good!</font>

869
01:04:49.333 --> 01:04:50.375
<font face="Comic Sans MS">I trust you.</font>

870
01:04:52.000 --> 01:04:53.333
<font face="Comic Sans MS">But I won't do this.</font>

871
01:04:55.708 --> 01:04:57.833
<font face="Comic Sans MS">Cao Shaolun is not a regular guy!</font>

872
01:04:57.917 --> 01:04:59.167
<font face="Comic Sans MS">Who is his father?</font>

873
01:04:59.208 --> 01:05:00.208
<font face="Comic Sans MS">A grand warlord!</font>

874
01:05:00.250 --> 01:05:01.583
<font face="Comic Sans MS">With hundreds of thousands of troops!</font>

875
01:05:01.625 --> 01:05:02.417
<font face="Comic Sans MS">And you?</font>

876
01:05:02.458 --> 01:05:04.000
<font face="Comic Sans MS">Just a local guardian!</font>

877
01:05:04.042 --> 01:05:07.083
<font face="Comic Sans MS">With the few of us, we're no match!</font>

878
01:05:07.125 --> 01:05:09.042
<font face="Comic Sans MS">We can't afford this!</font>

879
01:05:09.250 --> 01:05:11.875
<font face="Comic Sans MS">Guang is dead, I fear you may be next.</font>

880
01:05:11.917 --> 01:05:12.958
<font face="Comic Sans MS">You fear you may be next!</font>

881
01:05:13.000 --> 01:05:15.917
<font face="Comic Sans MS">You want me, a guardian, to release a murderer?</font>

882
01:05:18.083 --> 01:05:19.750
<font face="Comic Sans MS">I didn't think you'd be the biggest coward.</font>

883
01:05:19.833 --> 01:05:20.958
<font face="Comic Sans MS">I'm not afraid!</font>

884
01:05:21.000 --> 01:05:22.667
<font face="Comic Sans MS">I want to save you!</font>

885
01:05:22.875 --> 01:05:25.042
<font face="Comic Sans MS">I've been with you 30 years!</font>

886
01:05:25.083 --> 01:05:26.583
<font face="Comic Sans MS">I've done everything you said!</font>

887
01:05:26.667 --> 01:05:29.208
<font face="Comic Sans MS">I don't even mind being called a coward.</font>

888
01:05:29.250 --> 01:05:30.125
<font face="Comic Sans MS">Because.</font>

889
01:05:30.208 --> 01:05:32.208
<font face="Comic Sans MS">I trust you, you're my leader!</font>

890
01:05:32.250 --> 01:05:33.958
<font face="Comic Sans MS">I'll obey you in everything!</font>

891
01:05:34.250 --> 01:05:35.917
<font face="Comic Sans MS">But this time you must obey me!</font>

892
01:05:36.250 --> 01:05:37.458
<font face="Comic Sans MS">Release him!</font>

893
01:05:37.500 --> 01:05:39.667
<font face="Comic Sans MS">Someone told me the first day I became a guardian</font>

894
01:05:39.750 --> 01:05:41.458
<font face="Comic Sans MS">A guardian doesn't have to be very learned,</font>

895
01:05:41.500 --> 01:05:43.333
<font face="Comic Sans MS">But he must tell black from white.</font>

896
01:05:43.417 --> 01:05:45.125
<font face="Comic Sans MS">Right from wrong.</font>

897
01:05:45.167 --> 01:05:46.875
<font face="Comic Sans MS">Do you remember who told me that?</font>

898
01:05:47.750 --> 01:05:49.000
<font face="Comic Sans MS">You did.</font>

899
01:05:49.708 --> 01:05:50.958
<font face="Comic Sans MS">I trusted you, too.</font>

900
01:05:51.417 --> 01:05:53.375
<font face="Comic Sans MS">But many people will die!</font>

901
01:05:53.792 --> 01:05:56.875
<font face="Comic Sans MS">Is that worth it, for one Cao Shaolun?</font>

902
01:05:57.750 --> 01:06:01.708
<font face="Comic Sans MS">Ask the people what they want.</font>

903
01:06:02.250 --> 01:06:04.250
<font face="Comic Sans MS">Don't lecture them on justice</font>

904
01:06:04.292 --> 01:06:05.708
<font face="Comic Sans MS">or intergrity!</font>

905
01:06:06.458 --> 01:06:08.750
<font face="Comic Sans MS">Everyone just wants peace...</font>

906
01:06:09.208 --> 01:06:11.542
<font face="Comic Sans MS">To have a safe home and good job.</font>

907
01:06:13.000 --> 01:06:15.667
<font face="Comic Sans MS">Don't give them a hard time!</font>

908
01:06:19.917 --> 01:06:21.042
<font face="Comic Sans MS">You think we can solve everything</font>

909
01:06:21.083 --> 01:06:23.000
<font face="Comic Sans MS">if we kneel down.</font>

910
01:06:23.708 --> 01:06:26.000
<font face="Comic Sans MS">Just kneel first.</font>

911
01:06:27.250 --> 01:06:29.833
<font face="Comic Sans MS">It's critical to stay alive!</font>

912
01:06:37.958 --> 01:06:39.583
<font face="Comic Sans MS">If we kneel today,</font>

913
01:06:40.708 --> 01:06:42.417
<font face="Comic Sans MS">Will we still be able to stand up tomorrow?</font>

914
01:06:42.458 --> 01:06:43.542
<font face="Comic Sans MS">Can our future generations</font>

915
01:06:43.583 --> 01:06:46.500
<font face="Comic Sans MS">live with their heads held high?</font>

916
01:06:48.208 --> 01:06:49.667
<font face="Comic Sans MS">We are not slaves.</font>

917
01:06:50.167 --> 01:06:52.000
<font face="Comic Sans MS">We are the owners of Pucheng.</font>

918
01:06:55.042 --> 01:06:56.917
<font face="Comic Sans MS">The more we fear, the worse our fate.</font>

919
01:07:02.167 --> 01:07:04.333
<font face="Comic Sans MS">Cao Shaolun's arrival into our city</font>

920
01:07:07.417 --> 01:07:09.208
<font face="Comic Sans MS">has sealed Pucheng's fate.</font>

921
01:07:10.542 --> 01:07:12.958
<font face="Comic Sans MS">There is no escape for us.</font>

922
01:07:15.792 --> 01:07:16.417
<font face="Comic Sans MS">Yes,</font>

923
01:07:17.458 --> 01:07:18.792
<font face="Comic Sans MS">We may die,</font>

924
01:07:21.792 --> 01:07:23.458
<font face="Comic Sans MS">But everyone dies.</font>

925
01:07:24.375 --> 01:07:26.542
<font face="Comic Sans MS">Let's not die in vain.</font>

926
01:07:28.583 --> 01:07:29.958
<font face="Comic Sans MS">All right?</font>

927
01:07:47.750 --> 01:07:48.958
<font face="Comic Sans MS">Yang Kenan!</font>

928
01:08:08.833 --> 01:08:10.125
<font face="Comic Sans MS">What do you want?</font>

929
01:08:10.417 --> 01:08:12.000
<font face="Comic Sans MS">Boss Liu invited us here!</font>

930
01:08:12.417 --> 01:08:13.625
<font face="Comic Sans MS">You still don't understand?</font>

931
01:08:14.917 --> 01:08:15.958
<font face="Comic Sans MS">Sub-commander Liao</font>

932
01:08:16.458 --> 01:08:18.417
<font face="Comic Sans MS">Your job is done, go!</font>

933
01:08:18.792 --> 01:08:20.458
<font face="Comic Sans MS">Boss Liu said you must pay for your mistakes</font>

934
01:08:21.292 --> 01:08:22.417
<font face="Comic Sans MS">by killing him!</font>

935
01:08:23.833 --> 01:08:24.917
<font face="Comic Sans MS">Yang</font>

936
01:08:24.958 --> 01:08:27.583
<font face="Comic Sans MS">Don't put the blame on us in the underworld.</font>

937
01:08:27.875 --> 01:08:29.458
<font face="Comic Sans MS">We're just doing our jobs.</font>

938
01:08:31.917 --> 01:08:34.125
<font face="Comic Sans MS">Kill me first, if you can!</font>

939
01:09:19.750 --> 01:09:20.708
<font face="Comic Sans MS">Leave me!</font>

940
01:10:22.875 --> 01:10:23.833
<font face="Comic Sans MS">Go!</font>

941
01:11:27.000 --> 01:11:28.250
<font face="Comic Sans MS">Sheriff!</font>

942
01:11:55.792 --> 01:11:56.875
<font face="Comic Sans MS">Liao!</font>

943
01:12:02.417 --> 01:12:04.042
<font face="Comic Sans MS">You wouldn't go when I asked,</font>

944
01:12:05.125 --> 01:12:06.958
<font face="Comic Sans MS">So I must send you out!</font>

945
01:15:19.083 --> 01:15:19.833
<font face="Comic Sans MS">Out of my Way!</font>

946
01:15:19.875 --> 01:15:20.750
<font face="Comic Sans MS">Leave me!</font>

947
01:15:20.833 --> 01:15:23.167
<font face="Comic Sans MS">Wu!</font>

948
01:15:23.833 --> 01:15:25.792
<font face="Comic Sans MS">Calm down!</font>

949
01:15:25.833 --> 01:15:27.042
<font face="Comic Sans MS">Let go!</font>

950
01:15:27.083 --> 01:15:28.000
<font face="Comic Sans MS">Out of my Way!</font>

951
01:15:28.042 --> 01:15:28.708
<font face="Comic Sans MS">Leave me alone!</font>

952
01:15:28.750 --> 01:15:29.125
<font face="Comic Sans MS">Wu!</font>

953
01:15:29.167 --> 01:15:29.833
<font face="Comic Sans MS">All of you, let go!</font>

954
01:15:29.875 --> 01:15:32.667
<font face="Comic Sans MS">Calm down, it's useless!</font>

955
01:15:41.292 --> 01:15:42.583
<font face="Comic Sans MS">Why are you all standing here?</font>

956
01:15:43.542 --> 01:15:44.292
<font face="Comic Sans MS">Liu Cheng!</font>

957
01:15:45.000 --> 01:15:46.292
<font face="Comic Sans MS">You sent men to kill Liao!</font>

958
01:15:46.333 --> 01:15:47.583
<font face="Comic Sans MS">I want your life for this!</font>

959
01:15:48.125 --> 01:15:48.708
<font face="Comic Sans MS">Wrong!</font>

960
01:15:48.875 --> 01:15:49.875
<font face="Comic Sans MS">I'll tell you what happened.</font>

961
01:15:50.583 --> 01:15:52.625
<font face="Comic Sans MS">Yang offended Junior Commandant,</font>

962
01:15:52.708 --> 01:15:54.167
<font face="Comic Sans MS">Caused the death of his man.</font>

963
01:15:55.500 --> 01:15:59.250
<font face="Comic Sans MS">And will kill all of us in Pucheng</font>

964
01:15:59.792 --> 01:16:02.292
<font face="Comic Sans MS">Listen to what the people are saying!</font>

965
01:16:18.792 --> 01:16:20.083
<font face="Comic Sans MS">Sheriff Yang,</font>

966
01:16:20.375 --> 01:16:21.833
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>Once the Lao army storms the shy,</i></font>

967
01:16:22.542 --> 01:16:24.792
<font face="Comic Sans MS">They will kill everyone</font>

968
01:16:25.250 --> 01:16:26.708
<font face="Comic Sans MS">in the city!</font>

969
01:16:28.000 --> 01:16:29.042
<font face="Comic Sans MS">Sheriff Yang</font>

970
01:16:31.333 --> 01:16:32.375
<font face="Comic Sans MS">I beg you.</font>

971
01:16:33.083 --> 01:16:34.750
<font face="Comic Sans MS">Can you let the Junior Commandant go?</font>

972
01:16:35.667 --> 01:16:37.667
<font face="Comic Sans MS">Please, Let him go!</font>

973
01:16:39.792 --> 01:16:40.875
<font face="Comic Sans MS">Kenan,</font>

974
01:16:41.500 --> 01:16:43.292
<font face="Comic Sans MS">My son is still young!</font>

975
01:16:43.333 --> 01:16:46.208
<font face="Comic Sans MS">I just want him to grow up in peace!</font>

976
01:16:46.917 --> 01:16:49.042
<font face="Comic Sans MS">You don't want to see your daughter</font>

977
01:16:49.083 --> 01:16:51.417
<font face="Comic Sans MS">killed by Cao's army tomorrow, do you?</font>

978
01:16:58.500 --> 01:17:00.000
<font face="Comic Sans MS">I am devastated</font>

979
01:17:01.292 --> 01:17:03.458
<font face="Comic Sans MS">by the deaths of Liao and Guang.</font>

980
01:17:04.958 --> 01:17:06.292
<font face="Comic Sans MS">But this is not for revenge.</font>

981
01:17:07.375 --> 01:17:10.708
<font face="Comic Sans MS">I believe murderers should be punished.</font>

982
01:17:11.042 --> 01:17:12.167
<font face="Comic Sans MS">But, Sheriff Yang!</font>

983
01:17:12.500 --> 01:17:13.917
<font face="Comic Sans MS">What about us?</font>

984
01:17:30.125 --> 01:17:31.792
<font face="Comic Sans MS">Sheriff Yang!</font>

985
01:17:40.667 --> 01:17:42.458
<font face="Comic Sans MS">Sheriff Yang!</font>

986
01:17:43.625 --> 01:17:48.375
<font face="Comic Sans MS">My family has lived here for 5 generations.</font>

987
01:17:48.917 --> 01:17:51.000
<font face="Comic Sans MS">I am already in my 80s.</font>

988
01:17:51.583 --> 01:17:52.917
<font face="Comic Sans MS">I beg you!</font>

989
01:17:54.125 --> 01:17:56.208
<font face="Comic Sans MS">Please let my descendants live!</font>

990
01:17:56.250 --> 01:18:00.083
<font face="Comic Sans MS">I beg you, give it up!</font>

991
01:18:35.250 --> 01:18:36.333
<font face="Comic Sans MS">Father!</font>

992
01:18:36.375 --> 01:18:36.958
<font face="Comic Sans MS">Mother!</font>

993
01:18:37.000 --> 01:18:39.042
<font face="Comic Sans MS">Please get UP!</font>

994
01:18:39.083 --> 01:18:41.958
<font face="Comic Sans MS">Kneel with us and beg Sheriff Yang.</font>

995
01:18:42.000 --> 01:18:43.417
<font face="Comic Sans MS">Beg Sheriff Yang!</font>

996
01:18:43.458 --> 01:18:45.042
<font face="Comic Sans MS">Kneel down!</font>

997
01:18:47.500 --> 01:18:48.583
<font face="Comic Sans MS">Sheriff,</font>

998
01:18:50.167 --> 01:18:51.375
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>l.</i></font>

999
01:19:35.625 --> 01:19:37.042
<font face="Comic Sans MS">There is righteousness among the people.</font>

1000
01:19:38.292 --> 01:19:39.875
<font face="Comic Sans MS">Justice is in everyone's hearts.</font>

1001
01:19:41.917 --> 01:19:45.083
<font face="Comic Sans MS">We Yangs have been guardians here
for 3 generations.</font>

1002
01:19:46.000 --> 01:19:49.083
<font face="Comic Sans MS">We have been loyal and faithful;
our consciences are clear.</font>

1003
01:19:50.542 --> 01:19:52.458
<font face="Comic Sans MS">Today, you don't need me anymore.</font>

1004
01:19:53.125 --> 01:19:55.000
<font face="Comic Sans MS">I understand your fear.</font>

1005
01:19:58.417 --> 01:19:59.458
<font face="Comic Sans MS">Before daybreak...</font>

1006
01:20:00.208 --> 01:20:01.750
<font face="Comic Sans MS">I will resign as your Sheriff.</font>

1007
01:20:03.208 --> 01:20:06.208
<font face="Comic Sans MS">You all decide whether to let him go.</font>

1008
01:20:08.375 --> 01:20:10.375
<font face="Comic Sans MS">The Guardians...</font>

1009
01:20:11.750 --> 01:20:13.292
<font face="Comic Sans MS">are permenantly dismissed.</font>

1010
01:20:54.708 --> 01:20:56.292
<font face="Comic Sans MS">Xianger will love Guangzhou.</font>

1011
01:20:56.875 --> 01:20:58.583
<font face="Comic Sans MS">She will get to know many new schoolmates.</font>

1012
01:21:00.042 --> 01:21:01.875
<font face="Comic Sans MS">Give the men an extra month's pay.</font>

1013
01:21:19.583 --> 01:21:21.292
<font face="Comic Sans MS">You're staying here by yourself?</font>

1014
01:21:22.042 --> 01:21:23.292
<font face="Comic Sans MS">Is that useful?</font>

1015
01:21:24.375 --> 01:21:25.625
<font face="Comic Sans MS">I'm the one he wants.</font>

1016
01:21:26.000 --> 01:21:26.917
<font face="Comic Sans MS">With me here...</font>

1017
01:21:27.708 --> 01:21:29.458
<font face="Comic Sans MS">He won't vent his anger on the people.</font>

1018
01:21:32.250 --> 01:21:32.958
<font face="Comic Sans MS">I'm sorry.</font>

1019
01:21:40.375 --> 01:21:41.792
<font face="Comic Sans MS">Junior Commandant!</font>

1020
01:21:43.542 --> 01:21:44.458
<font face="Comic Sans MS">Come on out!</font>

1021
01:21:44.917 --> 01:21:46.042
<font face="Comic Sans MS">We're sorry!</font>

1022
01:21:46.083 --> 01:21:47.625
<font face="Comic Sans MS">We're releasing you.</font>

1023
01:21:49.917 --> 01:21:50.875
<font face="Comic Sans MS">Cut it open now!</font>

1024
01:21:52.292 --> 01:21:53.375
<font face="Comic Sans MS">You may not open it.</font>

1025
01:21:53.792 --> 01:21:55.208
<font face="Comic Sans MS">Please be serious, sir.</font>

1026
01:21:55.625 --> 01:21:56.292
<font face="Comic Sans MS">Junior Commandant,</font>

1027
01:21:57.750 --> 01:21:59.208
<font face="Comic Sans MS">Please come out!</font>

1028
01:21:59.583 --> 01:22:01.958
<font face="Comic Sans MS">Please forgive us, come out!</font>

1029
01:22:03.083 --> 01:22:04.083
<font face="Comic Sans MS">Junior Commandant...</font>

1030
01:22:05.750 --> 01:22:06.333
<font face="Comic Sans MS">Junior Commandant!</font>

1031
01:22:06.375 --> 01:22:09.958
<font face="Comic Sans MS">We all know that we were wrong!</font>

1032
01:22:16.417 --> 01:22:17.208
<font face="Comic Sans MS">Daddy!</font>

1033
01:22:17.792 --> 01:22:21.167
<font face="Comic Sans MS">You promised to play hide-and-seek
at Grandma's house.</font>

1034
01:22:21.208 --> 01:22:23.750
<font face="Comic Sans MS">I'll wait for you, hurry up!</font>

1035
01:22:25.333 --> 01:22:26.417
<font face="Comic Sans MS">I'll be very quick.</font>

1036
01:22:26.500 --> 01:22:28.333
<font face="Comic Sans MS">Show me a punch.</font>

1037
01:22:28.375 --> 01:22:29.042
<font face="Comic Sans MS">Strike!</font>

1038
01:22:31.500 --> 01:22:33.167
<font face="Comic Sans MS">Really good!</font>

1039
01:22:33.250 --> 01:22:34.250
<font face="Comic Sans MS">That was so fast</font>

1040
01:22:34.292 --> 01:22:36.000
<font face="Comic Sans MS">Daddy couldn't even see your fist.</font>

1041
01:22:36.042 --> 01:22:37.125
<font face="Comic Sans MS">But it hurts a little.</font>

1042
01:22:37.792 --> 01:22:39.000
<font face="Comic Sans MS">Give me a kiss.</font>

1043
01:22:40.250 --> 01:22:40.833
<font face="Comic Sans MS">One more.</font>

1044
01:22:42.708 --> 01:22:43.458
<font face="Comic Sans MS">And one more.</font>

1045
01:23:07.875 --> 01:23:08.958
<font face="Comic Sans MS">Sheriff!</font>

1046
01:23:09.417 --> 01:23:10.875
<font face="Comic Sans MS">We don't care where you go,</font>

1047
01:23:11.083 --> 01:23:12.667
<font face="Comic Sans MS">We just want to follow you.</font>

1048
01:23:13.292 --> 01:23:14.625
<font face="Comic Sans MS">What for?</font>

1049
01:23:14.833 --> 01:23:16.292
<font face="Comic Sans MS">All good things must come to an end.</font>

1050
01:23:16.750 --> 01:23:18.875
<font face="Comic Sans MS">You think I want to lead you monkeys around?</font>

1051
01:23:19.125 --> 01:23:19.875
<font face="Comic Sans MS">Go on.</font>

1052
01:23:20.625 --> 01:23:22.417
<font face="Comic Sans MS">We're leaving.</font>

1053
01:23:28.250 --> 01:23:29.333
<font face="Comic Sans MS">Sheriff.</font>

1054
01:23:33.500 --> 01:23:35.417
<font face="Comic Sans MS">Thank you for all these years of care.</font>

1055
01:23:36.667 --> 01:23:37.958
<font face="Comic Sans MS">I hope to have a chance</font>

1056
01:23:38.500 --> 01:23:40.125
<font face="Comic Sans MS">to repay you.</font>

1057
01:23:48.875 --> 01:23:49.667
<font face="Comic Sans MS">Go.</font>

1058
01:23:52.333 --> 01:23:53.125
<font face="Comic Sans MS">Take care.</font>

1059
01:24:49.000 --> 01:24:50.083
<font face="Comic Sans MS">Sheriff Yang,</font>

1060
01:24:52.375 --> 01:24:53.750
<font face="Comic Sans MS">They're leaving, why are you still here?</font>

1061
01:24:54.250 --> 01:24:56.708
<font face="Comic Sans MS">I have an extra seat, I could give you a lift.</font>

1062
01:24:57.917 --> 01:24:59.375
<font face="Comic Sans MS">Why do I need a lift from you?</font>

1063
01:25:00.000 --> 01:25:01.250
<font face="Comic Sans MS">Just take the children.</font>

1064
01:25:05.167 --> 01:25:06.500
<font face="Comic Sans MS">You're really staying?</font>

1065
01:25:11.000 --> 01:25:11.750
<font face="Comic Sans MS">Yes.</font>

1066
01:25:12.792 --> 01:25:14.458
<font face="Comic Sans MS">Knowing you will lose?</font>

1067
01:25:14.792 --> 01:25:16.292
<font face="Comic Sans MS">I didn't do anything wrong</font>

1068
01:25:16.333 --> 01:25:17.458
<font face="Comic Sans MS">So what will I lose?</font>

1069
01:26:38.958 --> 01:26:39.708
<font face="Comic Sans MS">Junior Commandant!</font>

1070
01:26:39.750 --> 01:26:41.833
<font face="Comic Sans MS">Please forgive us for being late!</font>

1071
01:26:42.417 --> 01:26:43.875
<font face="Comic Sans MS">Men, open the lock!</font>

1072
01:26:45.417 --> 01:26:47.250
<font face="Comic Sans MS">It's not for you to open.</font>

1073
01:26:48.292 --> 01:26:49.375
<font face="Comic Sans MS">Forgive me, Junior Commandant!</font>

1074
01:26:52.250 --> 01:26:54.208
<font face="Comic Sans MS">If you were not one of my father's dogs</font>

1075
01:26:54.250 --> 01:26:55.500
<font face="Comic Sans MS">I would have killed you long ago.</font>

1076
01:26:56.417 --> 01:26:57.542
<font face="Comic Sans MS">Whoever cuffed me</font>

1077
01:26:57.583 --> 01:26:59.333
<font face="Comic Sans MS">Will be the one to release me.</font>

1078
01:26:59.625 --> 01:27:00.708
<font face="Comic Sans MS">Yes, Junior Commandant!</font>

1079
01:27:02.958 --> 01:27:03.792
<font face="Comic Sans MS">Men!</font>

1080
01:27:03.833 --> 01:27:04.750
<font face="Comic Sans MS">Bring Yang Kenan!</font>

1081
01:27:04.833 --> 01:27:06.042
<font face="Comic Sans MS">I am here.</font>

1082
01:27:15.542 --> 01:27:19.333
<font face="Comic Sans MS">Sheriff Yang...</font>

1083
01:28:03.917 --> 01:28:04.833
<font face="Comic Sans MS">Come on.</font>

1084
01:28:19.167 --> 01:28:19.917
<font face="Comic Sans MS">Well?</font>

1085
01:28:20.792 --> 01:28:22.167
<font face="Comic Sans MS">Is the executioner here?</font>

1086
01:28:22.833 --> 01:28:24.500
<font face="Comic Sans MS">I think he's lost his way.</font>

1087
01:28:25.750 --> 01:28:27.500
<font face="Comic Sans MS">You need an executioner to chop off my head?</font>

1088
01:28:27.542 --> 01:28:29.000
<font face="Comic Sans MS">My head is right here.</font>

1089
01:28:31.125 --> 01:28:32.250
<font face="Comic Sans MS">Cut it off.</font>

1090
01:28:35.750 --> 01:28:37.042
<font face="Comic Sans MS">Cut it off!</font>

1091
01:28:57.875 --> 01:28:59.417
<font face="Comic Sans MS">How many hundred lives</font>

1092
01:29:02.042 --> 01:29:04.458
<font face="Comic Sans MS">may I exchange with my life?</font>

1093
01:29:07.333 --> 01:29:09.000
<font face="Comic Sans MS">I'm giving you my head, yet you won't cut!</font>

1094
01:29:10.333 --> 01:29:11.250
<font face="Comic Sans MS">Fine.</font>

1095
01:29:12.750 --> 01:29:14.292
<font face="Comic Sans MS">You want to defend the people so badly</font>

1096
01:29:14.333 --> 01:29:15.375
<font face="Comic Sans MS">And you want to die so badly.</font>

1097
01:29:15.917 --> 01:29:16.792
<font face="Comic Sans MS">I'll grant your wish.</font>

1098
01:29:18.958 --> 01:29:19.917
<font face="Comic Sans MS">Tie him up.</font>

1099
01:29:20.250 --> 01:29:21.083
<font face="Comic Sans MS">Let me</font>

1100
01:29:21.125 --> 01:29:22.417
<font face="Comic Sans MS">toy with him.</font>

1101
01:29:33.000 --> 01:29:34.167
<font face="Comic Sans MS">Cheers!</font>

1102
01:29:35.083 --> 01:29:37.875
<font face="Comic Sans MS">Junior Commandant is handsome and smart!</font>

1103
01:29:37.917 --> 01:29:39.167
<font face="Comic Sans MS">Impressive!</font>

1104
01:29:39.208 --> 01:29:41.542
<font face="Comic Sans MS">Truly a shining young hero!</font>

1105
01:29:42.917 --> 01:29:44.750
<font face="Comic Sans MS">Thank you for gracing my home</font>

1106
01:29:44.792 --> 01:29:46.667
<font face="Comic Sans MS">With your presence!</font>

1107
01:29:46.708 --> 01:29:48.708
<font face="Comic Sans MS">I am so honoured.</font>

1108
01:29:49.417 --> 01:29:50.667
<font face="Comic Sans MS">We are family from now on.</font>

1109
01:29:50.708 --> 01:29:52.167
<font face="Comic Sans MS">I will do anything for you.</font>

1110
01:29:59.583 --> 01:30:00.708
<font face="Comic Sans MS">Sir...</font>

1111
01:30:00.833 --> 01:30:03.083
<font face="Comic Sans MS">Eat when you eat, stop talking.</font>

1112
01:30:04.542 --> 01:30:05.250
<font face="Comic Sans MS">Let's eat!</font>

1113
01:30:06.292 --> 01:30:07.375
<font face="Comic Sans MS">Please, eat!</font>

1114
01:30:09.417 --> 01:30:10.500
<font face="Comic Sans MS">Oh, you're really eating?</font>

1115
01:30:17.708 --> 01:30:19.583
<font face="Comic Sans MS">Let's go look over there.</font>

1116
01:30:24.875 --> 01:30:26.917
<font face="Comic Sans MS">No... don't take that...</font>

1117
01:30:35.833 --> 01:30:36.542
<font face="Comic Sans MS">Don't take it...</font>

1118
01:30:45.583 --> 01:30:46.750
<font face="Comic Sans MS">Xianger, you're a good girl.</font>

1119
01:30:49.000 --> 01:30:50.458
<font face="Comic Sans MS">When you grow up</font>

1120
01:30:50.875 --> 01:30:52.958
<font face="Comic Sans MS">I'm sure you'll be a brave, heroic person.</font>

1121
01:30:55.250 --> 01:30:57.042
<font face="Comic Sans MS">Go to Grandma's house with Jiaoer.</font>

1122
01:30:57.500 --> 01:30:58.833
<font face="Comic Sans MS">I'll go be with Daddy.</font>

1123
01:30:58.875 --> 01:30:59.667
<font face="Comic Sans MS">All right?</font>

1124
01:31:22.333 --> 01:31:23.542
<font face="Comic Sans MS">Teachers!</font>

1125
01:31:23.583 --> 01:31:25.667
<font face="Comic Sans MS">You're safe now, come.</font>

1126
01:31:26.958 --> 01:31:29.875
<font face="Comic Sans MS">Miss Bai and Dayuan are dead!</font>

1127
01:31:32.500 --> 01:31:33.458
<font face="Comic Sans MS">Teachers!</font>

1128
01:31:34.458 --> 01:31:35.833
<font face="Comic Sans MS">I hand over these rascals to you.</font>

1129
01:31:38.708 --> 01:31:41.000
<font face="Comic Sans MS">Monkey King!</font>

1130
01:31:41.083 --> 01:31:44.042
<font face="Comic Sans MS">Don't go!</font>

1131
01:31:44.625 --> 01:31:45.417
<font face="Comic Sans MS">Stop crying!</font>

1132
01:31:46.792 --> 01:31:47.708
<font face="Comic Sans MS">Listen.</font>

1133
01:31:50.458 --> 01:31:53.708
<font face="Comic Sans MS">Grow up to be good people, you hear?</font>

1134
01:31:53.750 --> 01:31:55.667
<font face="Comic Sans MS">Yes, sir!</font>

1135
01:32:01.958 --> 01:32:04.333
<font face="Comic Sans MS">Where are you going, Monkey King?</font>

1136
01:32:07.333 --> 01:32:08.375
<font face="Comic Sans MS">To fight monsters!</font>

1137
01:32:28.083 --> 01:32:32.083
<font face="Comic Sans MS">Madam Yang, we're back!</font>

1138
01:33:06.167 --> 01:33:07.208
<font face="Comic Sans MS">Ma Feng</font>

1139
01:33:07.542 --> 01:33:08.667
<font face="Comic Sans MS">You've returned, too?</font>

1140
01:33:10.042 --> 01:33:11.833
<font face="Comic Sans MS">I don't charge a fee</font>

1141
01:33:12.500 --> 01:33:13.917
<font face="Comic Sans MS">For some things that must be done.</font>

1142
01:34:19.292 --> 01:34:20.167
<font face="Comic Sans MS">Well?</font>

1143
01:34:20.208 --> 01:34:22.250
<font face="Comic Sans MS">Isn't it fun to drink wine upside-down?</font>

1144
01:34:30.792 --> 01:34:33.292
<font face="Comic Sans MS">I told you last night, half of Pucheng will die.</font>

1145
01:34:33.333 --> 01:34:35.625
<font face="Comic Sans MS">Now, I want everyone to die.</font>

1146
01:34:35.875 --> 01:34:37.250
<font face="Comic Sans MS">And you'll be the last one!</font>

1147
01:34:37.292 --> 01:34:38.292
<font face="Comic Sans MS">So, hang in there.</font>

1148
01:34:43.000 --> 01:34:43.750
<font face="Comic Sans MS">Release.</font>

1149
01:34:52.792 --> 01:34:53.500
<font face="Comic Sans MS">Halt!</font>

1150
01:34:54.250 --> 01:34:55.167
<font face="Comic Sans MS">Who are you?</font>

1151
01:34:56.875 --> 01:34:58.667
<font face="Comic Sans MS">I bring a gift to Junior Commandant.</font>

1152
01:34:59.583 --> 01:35:00.417
<font face="Comic Sans MS">What gift?</font>

1153
01:35:01.292 --> 01:35:02.083
<font face="Comic Sans MS">Let me see it!</font>

1154
01:35:04.000 --> 01:35:04.958
<font face="Comic Sans MS">You may see it,</font>

1155
01:35:05.667 --> 01:35:07.125
<font face="Comic Sans MS">But I'm afraid your rank isn't high enough.</font>

1156
01:35:07.750 --> 01:35:08.583
<font face="Comic Sans MS">It's very...</font>

1157
01:35:08.875 --> 01:35:10.792
<font face="Comic Sans MS">very confidential.</font>

1158
01:35:14.458 --> 01:35:17.083
<font face="Comic Sans MS">If you insist, I'll show it to you.</font>

1159
01:35:19.583 --> 01:35:20.625
<font face="Comic Sans MS">I'm going to show you now.</font>

1160
01:35:22.375 --> 01:35:23.208
<font face="Comic Sans MS">You really want to see it?</font>

1161
01:35:28.333 --> 01:35:31.208
<font face="Comic Sans MS">Bring him to Junior Commandant, take his weapons!</font>

1162
01:36:34.083 --> 01:36:35.167
<font face="Comic Sans MS">Quickly...</font>

1163
01:36:38.542 --> 01:36:39.333
<font face="Comic Sans MS">Cheers!</font>

1164
01:36:47.417 --> 01:36:48.500
<font face="Comic Sans MS">What's wrong?</font>

1165
01:36:49.208 --> 01:36:50.250
<font face="Comic Sans MS">Stomach...</font>

1166
01:36:52.083 --> 01:36:53.125
<font face="Comic Sans MS">Me too!</font>

1167
01:36:54.958 --> 01:36:56.000
<font face="Comic Sans MS">Quick...</font>

1168
01:36:57.500 --> 01:36:58.542
<font face="Comic Sans MS">My turn!</font>

1169
01:36:58.792 --> 01:36:59.833
<font face="Comic Sans MS">Quickly...</font>

1170
01:37:06.792 --> 01:37:07.500
<font face="Comic Sans MS">Wait!</font>

1171
01:37:16.958 --> 01:37:17.583
<font face="Comic Sans MS">Junior Commandant!</font>

1172
01:37:17.958 --> 01:37:18.958
<font face="Comic Sans MS">Someone wants to see you outside.</font>

1173
01:37:19.208 --> 01:37:20.792
<font face="Comic Sans MS">He says he has a gift for you.</font>

1174
01:37:23.917 --> 01:37:25.167
<font face="Comic Sans MS">He came to join our game.</font>

1175
01:37:27.292 --> 01:37:27.833
<font face="Comic Sans MS">Send him up.</font>

1176
01:37:27.917 --> 01:37:28.417
<font face="Comic Sans MS">Yes, sir!</font>

1177
01:37:34.875 --> 01:37:35.958
<font face="Comic Sans MS">Come up!</font>

1178
01:37:36.292 --> 01:37:37.083
<font face="Comic Sans MS">Go!</font>

1179
01:37:45.000 --> 01:37:45.708
<font face="Comic Sans MS">Junior Commandant.</font>

1180
01:37:46.333 --> 01:37:48.292
<font face="Comic Sans MS">You changed into black clothes.</font>

1181
01:37:54.917 --> 01:37:56.000
<font face="Comic Sans MS">Behave.</font>

1182
01:38:01.875 --> 01:38:03.500
<font face="Comic Sans MS">Congratulations on conquering Pucheng!</font>

1183
01:38:04.083 --> 01:38:06.625
<font face="Comic Sans MS">I bring you a valuable gift.</font>

1184
01:38:07.125 --> 01:38:08.750
<font face="Comic Sans MS">A... a gift?</font>

1185
01:38:08.917 --> 01:38:09.625
<font face="Comic Sans MS">Of course.</font>

1186
01:38:10.917 --> 01:38:12.250
<font face="Comic Sans MS">You want to rescue a cooked duck?</font>

1187
01:38:13.417 --> 01:38:14.542
<font face="Comic Sans MS">Let me see what it is?</font>

1188
01:38:15.042 --> 01:38:16.125
<font face="Comic Sans MS">Don't get too excited!</font>

1189
01:38:16.167 --> 01:38:17.083
<font face="Comic Sans MS">I'll get it for you right away.</font>

1190
01:38:19.208 --> 01:38:19.833
<font face="Comic Sans MS">Bring it.</font>

1191
01:38:19.875 --> 01:38:20.708
<font face="Comic Sans MS">What?</font>

1192
01:38:21.417 --> 01:38:22.625
<font face="Comic Sans MS">What I just gave you.</font>

1193
01:38:22.708 --> 01:38:23.500
<font face="Comic Sans MS">What?</font>

1194
01:38:23.542 --> 01:38:24.583
<font face="Comic Sans MS">Where is the thing I just gave you?</font>

1195
01:38:24.667 --> 01:38:25.583
<font face="Comic Sans MS">What thing?</font>

1196
01:38:33.250 --> 01:38:33.833
<font face="Comic Sans MS">Junior Commandant!</font>

1197
01:38:48.542 --> 01:38:50.167
<font face="Comic Sans MS">I knew you didn't have a gift.</font>

1198
01:38:50.208 --> 01:38:51.292
<font face="Comic Sans MS">It's a trick.</font>

1199
01:38:51.500 --> 01:38:52.875
<font face="Comic Sans MS">I'm not tricking you!</font>

1200
01:38:53.542 --> 01:38:55.792
<font face="Comic Sans MS">My gift was to release Yang Kenan for you.</font>

1201
01:38:55.875 --> 01:38:57.167
<font face="Comic Sans MS">To help you build up some karma points.</font>

1202
01:38:57.583 --> 01:38:58.375
<font face="Comic Sans MS">But we don't need it anymore</font>

1203
01:38:58.417 --> 01:38:59.542
<font face="Comic Sans MS">Since you killed another person.</font>

1204
01:39:01.375 --> 01:39:02.583
<font face="Comic Sans MS">Why do I need karma points?</font>

1205
01:39:02.958 --> 01:39:04.542
<font face="Comic Sans MS">Don't you know why I let you up here?</font>

1206
01:39:05.000 --> 01:39:05.708
<font face="Comic Sans MS">It's because it's...</font>

1207
01:39:05.750 --> 01:39:07.208
<font face="Comic Sans MS">Fun!</font>

1208
01:40:21.583 --> 01:40:22.708
<font face="Comic Sans MS">There's an explosion at the army camp!</font>

1209
01:40:23.792 --> 01:40:25.708
<font face="Comic Sans MS">Hurry, see what's going on!</font>

1210
01:41:44.458 --> 01:41:45.250
<font face="Comic Sans MS">Sheriff!</font>

1211
01:42:58.250 --> 01:42:59.417
<font face="Comic Sans MS">I told you to behave!</font>

1212
01:43:00.333 --> 01:43:01.417
<font face="Comic Sans MS">Why must you get me in trouble?</font>

1213
01:43:01.917 --> 01:43:03.000
<font face="Comic Sans MS">When did I do that?</font>

1214
01:43:03.792 --> 01:43:05.292
<font face="Comic Sans MS">I came to kill the bastard.</font>

1215
01:43:05.833 --> 01:43:06.583
<font face="Comic Sans MS">If you kill him</font>

1216
01:43:06.958 --> 01:43:07.833
<font face="Comic Sans MS">You'll destroy me!</font>

1217
01:43:07.875 --> 01:43:08.708
<font face="Comic Sans MS">Get it?</font>

1218
01:43:37.208 --> 01:43:38.250
<font face="Comic Sans MS">How's this</font>

1219
01:43:39.042 --> 01:43:40.417
<font face="Comic Sans MS">Kill the bastard for me,</font>

1220
01:43:40.625 --> 01:43:41.667
<font face="Comic Sans MS">And I'll kill his dad for you.</font>

1221
01:43:42.292 --> 01:43:43.583
<font face="Comic Sans MS">I guarantee you'll be made Commandant.</font>

1222
01:43:45.542 --> 01:43:46.292
<font face="Comic Sans MS">Can you?</font>

1223
01:45:20.500 --> 01:45:21.125
<font face="Comic Sans MS">Let's</font>

1224
01:45:46.875 --> 01:45:48.250
<font face="Comic Sans MS"><i>Y.!</i></font>

1225
01:46:10.042 --> 01:46:10.583
<font face="Comic Sans MS">Kenan!</font>

1226
01:46:12.375 --> 01:46:13.333
<font face="Comic Sans MS">Go,now!</font>

1227
01:47:03.625 --> 01:47:04.375
<font face="Comic Sans MS">Sheriff!</font>

1228
01:47:22.583 --> 01:47:23.375
<font face="Comic Sans MS">Stop pacing.</font>

1229
01:48:08.375 --> 01:48:09.292
<font face="Comic Sans MS">Sheriff!</font>

1230
01:49:07.500 --> 01:49:09.000
<font face="Comic Sans MS">The heavens...</font>

1231
01:49:09.042 --> 01:49:10.875
<font face="Comic Sans MS">choose who will die.</font>

1232
01:49:38.500 --> 01:49:40.292
<font face="Comic Sans MS">I am Cao Ying's son.</font>

1233
01:49:41.667 --> 01:49:42.667
<font face="Comic Sans MS">I am Cao...</font>

1234
01:49:51.875 --> 01:49:53.500
<font face="Comic Sans MS">Cao Ying is my father!</font>

1235
01:50:04.667 --> 01:50:06.458
<font face="Comic Sans MS">Kill him!</font>

1236
01:50:43.958 --> 01:50:46.875
<font face="Comic Sans MS">Remember when Master punished me</font>

1237
01:50:47.250 --> 01:50:49.208
<font face="Comic Sans MS">and forbade me food and water</font>

1238
01:50:49.333 --> 01:50:50.708
<font face="Comic Sans MS">for 3 days? thankfully, you...</font>

1239
01:50:50.750 --> 01:50:52.833
<font face="Comic Sans MS">Enough, already!</font>

1240
01:50:53.875 --> 01:50:55.583
<font face="Comic Sans MS">I brought you an egg-</font>

1241
01:50:56.333 --> 01:50:57.500
<font face="Comic Sans MS">You're eternally grateful.</font>

1242
01:50:58.292 --> 01:51:00.500
<font face="Comic Sans MS">You've told me hundreds of times.</font>

1243
01:51:00.875 --> 01:51:03.458
<font face="Comic Sans MS">Because of the egg and Master,</font>

1244
01:51:04.167 --> 01:51:06.167
<font face="Comic Sans MS">I will always give you a 30% advantage.</font>

1245
01:51:06.750 --> 01:51:07.583
<font face="Comic Sans MS">So when I hit you</font>

1246
01:51:07.708 --> 01:51:09.250
<font face="Comic Sans MS">you can't hit back.</font>

1247
01:51:13.667 --> 01:51:14.708
<font face="Comic Sans MS">Always...</font>

1248
01:51:15.833 --> 01:51:17.042
<font face="Comic Sans MS">Times have changed.</font>

1249
01:51:17.958 --> 01:51:19.917
<font face="Comic Sans MS">Ours was not a long-term career.</font>

1250
01:51:22.458 --> 01:51:24.542
<font face="Comic Sans MS">There is no 'always.'</font>

1251
01:52:16.333 --> 01:52:17.375
<font face="Comic Sans MS">Thank you.</font>

1252
01:52:19.583 --> 01:52:20.583
<font face="Comic Sans MS">You're welcome.</font>

1253
01:52:22.250 --> 01:52:23.167
<font face="Comic Sans MS">It's just as you said:</font>

1254
01:52:26.375 --> 01:52:28.292
<font face="Comic Sans MS">Justice exists only when maintained.</font>

1255
01:53:01.083 --> 01:53:04.542
<font face="Comic Sans MS">Days later, Cao's army headed to Pucheng</font>

1256
01:53:04.583 --> 01:53:08.500
<font face="Comic Sans MS">with orders to destroy, the Southern army</font>

1257
01:53:08.542 --> 01:53:11.083
<font face="Comic Sans MS">fought the Cao army 10 miles outside Pucheng</font>

1258
01:53:11.125 --> 01:53:14.750
<font face="Comic Sans MS">and defeated them, killing Cao.</font>

1259
01:53:21.375 --> 01:53:22.292
<font face="Comic Sans MS">I should go.</font>

1260
01:53:23.208 --> 01:53:24.875
<font face="Comic Sans MS">When you come again,</font>

1261
01:53:24.917 --> 01:53:25.875
<font face="Comic Sans MS">Remember to look me up.</font>

1262
01:53:26.417 --> 01:53:27.542
<font face="Comic Sans MS">I will trim your beard again</font>

1263
01:53:27.667 --> 01:53:28.333
<font face="Comic Sans MS">Free of charge.</font>

1264
01:53:29.375 --> 01:53:30.833
<font face="Comic Sans MS">If you want to roam the country</font>

1265
01:53:30.875 --> 01:53:31.958
<font face="Comic Sans MS">And be a wanderer,</font>

1266
01:53:32.125 --> 01:53:33.167
<font face="Comic Sans MS">You can look me up.</font>

1267
01:53:35.250 --> 01:53:36.042
<font face="Comic Sans MS">I do...</font>

1268
01:53:36.583 --> 01:53:38.208
<font face="Comic Sans MS">I want to roam the country,</font>

1269
01:53:38.250 --> 01:53:39.333
<font face="Comic Sans MS">Uphold justice,</font>

1270
01:53:39.375 --> 01:53:40.833
<font face="Comic Sans MS">And be a heroine!</font>

1271
01:53:43.500 --> 01:53:46.083
<font face="Comic Sans MS">We'll talk when you're grown up.</font>

1272
01:53:48.500 --> 01:53:49.417
<font face="Comic Sans MS">My friend Ma Feng,</font>

1273
01:53:49.917 --> 01:53:50.708
<font face="Comic Sans MS">Take care of yourself.</font>

1274
01:54:00.083 --> 01:54:01.042
<font face="Comic Sans MS">Take care.</font>

1275
01:54:03.500 --> 01:54:04.333
<font face="Comic Sans MS">Take care.</font>

1276
01:54:11.125 --> 01:54:12.208
<font face="Comic Sans MS">Ma Feng!</font>

1277
01:54:12.542 --> 01:54:14.042
<font face="Comic Sans MS">Where will you go?</font>

1278
01:54:15.917 --> 01:54:16.917
<font face="Comic Sans MS">I don't know.</font>

1279
01:54:17.333 --> 01:54:18.417
<font face="Comic Sans MS">You'll have to ask...</font>

1280
01:54:18.458 --> 01:54:20.042
<font face="Comic Sans MS">Taiping, here.</font>

1281
01:54:30.542 --> 01:54:31.167
<font face="Comic Sans MS">Taiping!</font>
